<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">unfoldingWord Literal Text</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Laisiukwak Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samuel Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam.</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">Samuel Laisiukwak Kenabe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Samuel kenabe Israel gwangram kendeu ha rau jüja mie. Cide Saul tsit gade ndeulu. Pecai cide David mmi riakdai hegwang ketei ha raugai. Maha keyi kedadung gecai Jerusalem tui kelu, David Bethsheba de ngngwa kemau tei kedi, nah Absalom kemlai hadung.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">David Judah gwangpei (1:1-4:12)</para>
  <para style="io1">David Israel de ngngwa ket teikelu (5:1-24:25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">David Saul tsit ha siukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Saul tsai kedicai, David Amalekme de regi lwe cailigwang nah Ziglag ga langnane bamdi. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Lang cumne benai, mipeige Saul ramzeuki gade gwang pe nia kehak ge kailu nah pe peu gage rebui pwagai. Pa David da gwang kecudau pa hangdeu ga keumie nah ngkumpung eh zeu miedi. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />David pe dage rang eh, “Nang dai gade gwang lano?” Pa keli eh, “Ih Israelme ramzeuki gade pak mbai luda.” <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />David pe dage rang eh, “Kehereide, dainzwa di bi kecu de ada ranglia lo.” Pa sam keligai, “Minadung hereu gade pak dida. Mina kekieege kau dida nah kekieege tsai dida. Saul nah pe napei Jonathan de tsai dida.” <verse eid="2SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />David rehangpei da ranggai, “Nang dainzwa Saul nah pe napei Jonathan tsaidi kecu cilu dino?” <verse eid="2SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Rehangpei keligai, “Ih mning mezing eh Gilboa Deutu ga lage, cika Saul pe hengei ga ngngei lwe bam, nah hekwen bagidung nah cide teukelame pecu gwa canglu lai eh la. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Saul nreu gwanggai nah acu ngaulu delwe acu qugai. Ih keligai, ‘Ih aika bam.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Pa a dage rang, ‘Nang cau no?’ Ih pecu keligai, ‘Ih au Amalekme.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Pa a dage rang, ‘Nang a reuga sap lwe acu teitsetdi lo, kedanemene keherei süt kecu ada gwang bam dida, dede keringria ada bamreu.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Cine Ih pereu ga sap lwe pecu teitsetdi, kedanemene pa kaukedi cai ringdai gai kelak Ih ci kedine. Pecai Ih pe peu ga pe hegwangpeurwa kebamde keulu nah pe ba ga kebam pe tah de, nah cidungde nda pwa gwang la delie, a kedibo.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Cidau David pe gunia teuhak di, nah pecu ngngwa kebamme pelane pa nzwa teidi. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Penui suisia sütdi, hap, nah tinghegi kecang mmwang bamdi, Saul nah pe napei Jonathan ziemne, RAMPAUBE minadung ziemne, nah Israel leuhme ziemne kedanemene penui kingtie gade kau kedine. <verse eid="2SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />David rehangbe dage rang, “Nang dai gade gwang lano?” Pa keligai, “Ih au aipau deu ga, Amalekme sangme napei ge.” <verse eid="2SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />David pe dage rang, “Dai ziemne nang RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelu hegwangpei de n ba le teitset kera hingdi meno?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />David rehangme ge de qu lwe rangdi, “Mie delwe pecu teitsetdi lu.” Cine cipau pei de mie delwe pecu teitsetdi, nah Amalekme pei tsaidi. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Pecai David Amalekme pei tsai paau dage rang, “N jai n peu ga bam kedanemene nkatei n mui le zierang tei eh ncu mmau eh, ‘Ih RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelu hegwangpei de teitset dida,’” de eh kerang ne.<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Pecai David Saul nah pe napei Jonathan de kensung lei aide tei gai. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Pa minadung de Lakpi Lei aide Judah namedung de ledeu beulo aja kaigai, Jashar Laisiukwak ga rauteu kela de.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Israel, N kendube,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">tsaidi da, n bam kehudung gade teitset dida!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Kengkiengme dainzwa kau dino!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Gath gade cide rang helo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">cide sah helo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">Ashkelon lampui gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">iciude Philistinme napuidung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">suiyi teikelak ne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">iciude hegeurum kemak napuidung de</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">peu hengyi kelakne.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Gilboa Lamlwadung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">cika peu nreu ga hezin mede tingrui so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">mede luhdung de peu recadung ziemne mei buibeu so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">kedanemene cika kengkieng reunet de tei herah dida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">Saul reunet de maca le keniak si meda.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Teitset kedime jai gade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">kengkieng me paudung gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Jonathan lakpi caili dailu meda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">nah Saul Kingtie mta cailigwang ma.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Saul nah Jonathan penai teilung ga keku nah ngaugia puila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">nah penai ketsai daude kerepüt ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Penai au helie swade mzet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">penai au hinghodung swade ngkieng.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Nnui Israel napuimedung, Saul reuga haplo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">nnuide hepai kegie nah jeweldung le nnui pwa tei kebeube de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">nah kecak hetaniadung nnui nia ga kai kebeube de.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Dainzwa kengkiengme hereu gade kaudi bi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Jonathan de n kengkieng bamdung gade teitsetdi.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Ih n ziemne hapla, a sinabe Jonathan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Nang au adade pemi hunglie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">N keku au a ziemne disüt lie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">mipui keku swade yiki.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Kengkiengme dainzwa kaudi no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">nah hereunetdung gah dino!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">David de Judah Gwangpei keniakkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Aipaucai David RAMPAUBE dade keteu nah rangdi, “Ih Judahme namdidung ket paube ga hang zie mi?” RAMPAUBE pecu keligai, “Hang cu.” David rangdi, “Daipau namdi ga Ih mie lai?” RAMPAUBE keligai, “Hebron ga.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Cine David penau hangna de ngngwa lwe cika hangdi, Ahinoam Jezreel gade, nah Abigail Carmel gade, Nabal gu hemipui. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />David pecu ngngwa kela mipeidung de ngngwalu, nah penui pe kilungme de nzang ciaklu, delwe Hebron namdidung ga gwanglu, nah penui cika lungh di. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Pecai Judah gade mipeidung gwang nah David de Judahme reu hegwang teikera keniaklu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Penui David de ranglia, “Jabesh Gilead mepeidung ne Saul de kungdi.” <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />Cine David samgwame de Jabesh Gilead mepeidung dage langgai nah penui dage rangdi, “Nnuide RAMPAUBE ne samlam beu delie, nnui masang aide nnui mpaube Saul de pwa lia kegaine nah pecu kung kebeune. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Cu peu RAMPAUBE de samting samkak kelu masang nah kesamsang nnuide pwalia lu. Ih de keyi aide pwalia zie nnuide kedanemene nnui heta aide tei kegaine. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Cine cu, peu n ba ngkienglu; ku lu kedanemene Saul nnui mpaube tsai dida, nah Judah kilungme acu penui reu hegwang teikera keniak luda.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">David penai Saul maame reutak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Dede Ner napei Abner, Saul gu reugwame muiteube, Saul napei Ishbosheth de tuilu delwe pecu Mahanaim ga nzang gwangdi. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Pa Ishbosheth de Gilead, Asher, Jezreel, Ephraim, Benjamin, nah Israelme pelane reu hegwang teidi. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Saul napei Ishbosheth, mmi riakdai di pa Israelme reu hegwang tei ndeu kecudau, nah pa mmi kena ge hegwang tei. Dede Judah kilungme David caisui di. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />David Hebron ga Judah leuhme reu mmi hena eh kei herok ge hegwang tei.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Ner napei Abner, Saul napei Ishbosheth kilamedung, Mahanaim gade Gibeon ga tetkai di. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Zeruiah napei Joab nah David kilamedung mie eh Gibeon rejaai gade penuide redau. Penui cika ntumlu, hemaa ge rejaai tuge lam nah keda maabe keda tule bie. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abner Joab dage rangdi, “Rehangmedung de peu cuhlu nah anui dwa renia lo.” Cidau Joab ranggai, “Peu penuide cuhlu.” <verse eid="2SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Cidau rehangme cuhlu nah gwang ngkwalu, hang kereiehkena Benjamin penai Saul napei Ishbosheth ziemne, nah David kilame kakgade hang kereiehkena. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Mipei hangge ge kecu pe ngauraume de tuilu pe peu teulwe nah pe kingtie pe ngauraume lamge reugai nah penui kaumie nsamdi. Ciziemne cipau bam de pwa “Helkath Hazzurim,” de qulu, mede “Kingtie luh,” Gibeon ga kebam de. <verse eid="2SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Cipaunai regi mdi sütdi nah Abner nah Israel mepeidung de David kilamedung dwade ngamdi.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Zeruiah napeime hangcum cika bam: Joab, nah Abishai, nah Asahel. Asahel au heti nzwa pak mzet süt lula. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asahel Abner de lampui tet lampak mene nnaka eh pecu gwazui mie. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abner pecai nreu gwang pie gai nah rangdi, “Cide nang ni Asahel?” Pa keligai, “Cide Ih delie.” <verse eid="2SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abner pe dage rangdi, “N hile mede zetle nreu gwanglu, nah rehangme gede nimlu nah pe reunet keulu.” Dede Asahel nreu caisim ma. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Cine Abner Asahel dage rangdai gai, “Acu gwa sita dilu. Daitei Ih ncu hangdeu gage teukau laino? Dainzwa Ih n sinabe, Joab dage a zu punglia lulai?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Dede Asahel nreu caisim raudi, nah cine Abner pepum gage pe ngei tang lebie pwa pecu reu gai, iciu eh hengei pepum hia rela mpetdi. Asahel kaumie di nah cikade tsaidi. Cine cinzwa kedi cai Asahel kaumie nah tsai kedi bam ga keheibe de kegwangme, pa mtak nah sapdung bamdi.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Dede Joab nah Abishai Abner de zui miedi. Tingnaimiak nlüt kezeu dau, penai Ammah deutu ga gwanglu, Giah taiga kebam Gibeon hetaideu lampuiki le. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Benjamin leuh mipeidung Abner caiga penui ngkwa ncütlu nah lamlwa twang ga saplu. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Pecai Abner Joab de qugai nah rangdi, “Kingtie de ngkap lamui zieni? Nang ci meni kekam benai cide ka di kera? Zie daikieege zie reu no nang rangbeu kera n minadung de penui sinamedungde gwa kecu peu mtak kera?” <verse eid="2SA 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Joab keligai, “Tinggwang ringkela nzwa, nang cide rangdi melie cai, a reugwame pe sinamedung de tingba kemakta gwala zie nage!” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Cine Joab telui kwagai, nah pe minadung pelane mtak di nah Israel de gwasi tadi, mede penui keregi de si tadi. <verse eid="2SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abner nah pe minadung cipau ziu tetcang eh Arabah de kah gwang. Penui Jordan de kahlu, pecia benai tingcang tet sap muilu, delwe Mahanaim gwang canglu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Joab Abner de gwa kecu gade cailigwang lu. Pa pe minadung peciakne de teu hekwalu, nah cika Asahel nah David reugwame hang kereiehekui gahdi. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Dede David minadung Benjamin gu minadung 360 Abner de ngngwa kelame de teitsetdi. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Pecai penui Asahel de pwalu nah pe pei de kung kecu herau gage pecu kungdi, Bethlehem ga kebam de. Joab nah pe minadung tingmui hebeuh teicang, nah tingcang nuge penui Hebron ga gwang canglu.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Saul kilungme nah David leuhme kakga keregi tie süt bamdi. David ngkieng reureu di, dede Saul kilungme nnei reureu di.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Hebron gade David da mipeinadung lunghlu. Pe neraibe cai Amnon, Jezreel mepui Ahinoam dade lunghlu. <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Pe na pekenabe, Kileab, Abigail dade lungh, Carmel mepei Nabal gu hemipui. Pe kecumbe, Absalom, caige Maacah napei, Talmai napui, Geshur ga hegwangpei. <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />David napei pemdaibe, Adonijah, caige Haggith napei. Pe napei pemengeibe cai Shephatiah, Abital napei, <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />nah peherokbe, Ithream, David nau Eglah napei. Pe napei aidungde Hebron gade David de mna beu.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abner David taiga kemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Cinzwa eh Saul kilungme nah David kilungme kakga hereu tei kebam tingdau Abner be pekatei pecu Saul kilung gade tei ngkienglu. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Saul da nauseupui ge bam pezi Rizpah lie cuge, Aiah napui. Ishbosheth Abner dage rangdi, “Daitei eh nang a pei nauseupui da mie no?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Cidau Ishbosheth sam siu lwe Abner pe rata sütdi nah rangdi, “Ih Judahme gu heteu peu ge ni? Henai Ih samsang de pwalia bam Saul kilungme de, n pei, pe siname de, nah pe zangme de, ncu pwa David ba gage kai kedi teimene. Dede nang cu Ih aipau puide dage kemau teigai kedi ziemne acu mmau au ni? <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Peu Tinggwang de ada teigailu, Abner, nah ciswade, magade Ih David ziemne tei mecai RAMPAUBE pe dage pesam pet kebeu nzwa, <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />hegwangram de Saul kilungme dade keu caili kera nah David de peu hegwang tei kerane Israel reu nah Judah reu, Dan gade Beersheba kecang.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishbosheth, Abner sam kedadung kelilu tadi, kedanemene pa pecu hing kedine.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Pecai Abner samgwamedung de David da langgai pe keleu tei eh peu rang eh, “Cau deu no aide? Acu ngngwa samting samkak lulo, nah nang ngau zie a ba nda la kecu, Israel pelane de nda ngngwa gwang kera.” <verse eid="2SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />David keligai, “Makeyige, Ih ncu ngngwa samting samkak luzie. Dede Ih n dade mage keumaisia kela de au nang acu pie kera kegwang dau nang Saul napui Michal de ngngwa gwang rai maige, nang a zu ngau lak.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Pecai David samgwame langgai Saul napei Ishbosheth dage, rang eh, “Acu a nau Michal de peulo, Ih pe ziemne Philistinme geudung pemi haige suh di delu.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Cine Ishbosheth Michal de langgai delwe pe nahpei Paltiel, Laish napei dade pecu ngngwalu. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Pe nahpei pecu nzang mie, pa hap jüja nzang gwang, nah Bahurim kecang pe caisui gwang. Pecai Abner pe dage rangdi, “Cu kilung cailigwang cu.” Cine pa caili di.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abner Israel hangkiame de resiu eh ranggai, “Ndaa nnui David de peu nnui reu hegwang teikera tei. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Cu teicu. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE David de sampet beuda, rang eh, ‘A kilabe David ba gade Ih a minadung Israel mede Philistinme ba gade nah penui ngauraume pelane ba gade kelibeu zie.’” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abner de pekatei Benjamin gu minadung de resiu. Pecai Abner David dede resiu kera Hebron ga mie, Israelme nah Benjamin leuhme pelane teineu kebam hengim de ranglia kerane. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abner nah pe mina ngkai Hebron ga David de pie kera gwang keludau, David penui ziemne hengyi kera mteipwa bam. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abner David dage rang nci liagai, “Ih cuh zie nah Israel pelane de ncu teu hekwa beuzie, a mpaube hegwangpei, iciude penui ncu ngngwa samting samkak lu kerane, iciude nang luneu kelabe pelane reu hegwang teilu kerane.” Cine David Abner de langgi di, nah Abner ziune tetdi.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joab ne Abner de daptset kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Pecai David reugwame nah Joab hereu gwalwe gwangdai nah penui ma tuikelu kekiee punggwang. Dede Abner Hebron ga David de ngngwa bam ma. David pecu langgi di, nah Abner ziune tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Joab nah pecu ngngwa kela regwame pelane gwang keludau, penui Joab da ranggai, “Ner napei Abner hegwangpei da gwang, nah hegwangpei pecu langgi di, nah Abner ziune tetdi.” <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Cidau Joab hegwangpei da gwang nah rangdi, “Nang daitei di no? Pielo, Abner nda gwang! Dai ziemne nang pecu langgi no, nah pa tet dida? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Nang ci meni Ner napei Abner ncu cwa kera gwang kecu nah nang tei lai eh kebamdung nah nang daitei bambi kecu leune cilu kerane?” <verse eid="2SA 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Joab David dade tet kedi dau, pa samgwame de Abner taiga langgai, nah penui pecu Sirah gu tekwa gade ngngwa cailigwang, dede David aide cima.<verse eid="2SA 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abner Hebron ga cailigwang kecudau, Joab pecu herieki sum ga teumpet tsamlu pecu ngngwa ngkim resiu kerane. Cikade Joab pecu peza reu gai nah pecu teitset di. Ainzwa eh, Joab pe caihereibe Asahel kum peeilu. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />David aipau ha de siulu ge pa rangdi, “Ih nah a hegwangram au RAMPAUBE dwa de madaude mau ma Ner napei Abner de teitset kecu gade au. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Peu Abner tsaikedi maude Joab peu ga nah pe pei leuhme pelane da gwang kelube teilu. Peu cika madaude gah helo Joab kilung ga migede majam teei kecume mede pe geu mateei mede mige tet gailak nah hetuitie pwalwe tet maikesia mede kingtie le teitset di kecume mede taktyei kera gah kecume.” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Cine Joab nah pe sinabe Abishai Abner de teitset di, kedanemene pa penai sinabe Asahel de Gibeon reu gade teitset di kecune.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />David Joab dage nah pecu ngngwa kebam pelane dage rangdi, “Nnui gunia teurak di, rosopai bahlu, nah Abner pau dwa gade hei eh haplu.” Cu hegwangpei David tsai paau caiga tet jüja pe pau de nzang gwang. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Penui Abner de Hebron gage kungdi. Hegwangpei Abner rau gade hapdi nah hap ntei sütdi, nah mina pelane de hapdi. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Hegwangpei Abner ziemne pesuisia bam nah leitei gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Abner de peu kemieme ketsai nzwa tsai zieni?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />N ba kena de au kang ma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">N pi au keu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Mina mateunsam la kemak namedung dwade kaudi kela nzwa, nang de kaudida.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Mina pelane pe ziemne hap daidi. <verse eid="2SA 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Mina pelane gwang David de peu matyeilu kera tei tingba kebam dauge, dede David pesam petgai, “Peu Tinggwang de a dage teigai lulo, nah ci swade, magade Ih tangku mede makeheibe liede tingnaimiak nghung kemakne msi cai.” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Mina pelane David lungrei de ngau di, nah cide penui suilu, kedanemene hegwangpei tei kegai keheibe de penui sui kelune. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Cine mina pelane nah Israelme pelane cipaunai cilu hegwangpei lungning kemak de Ner napei Abner de teitset kera. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Hegwangpei pe kilame dage rangdi, “Nnui ci meni hegwangna nah mina kenlang mege henai Israel ga kaukedi? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Henai Ih mnei bam, Ih keniak kelu hegwangpei liede. Mina aidungde, Zeruiah napeidung, a ziemne penui zaisia zu dilie. RAMPAUBE de peu makesia tei kelabe de pe ta kesia ketei ziehi peucaili lo pecu saja peu eh, pa hilu delu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 28:4">Lei. 28:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishbosheth de daptset kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Cidau Saul napei Ishbosheth, Abner Hebron gade tsaikedi siu luge, pe ba mneidi, nah Israelme pelane hing bamdi. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Saul napei mipei hangna bam nah penai reugwame maadung reu muiteume ge. Hangge zi cai Baanah nah kedabe zi cai Recab, Benjamin ramme Beerothme pei Rimmon napei kena (kedanemene Beeroth de de Benjamin gu lie bamla, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />nah Beerothme Gittaim gage pak gaidi nah cika lungh jüja bamdi cu kecang de).<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Cu Jonathan, Saul napei, pe na mipei nage pe pi sia eh bam. Pa mmi mengei dau Saul nah Jonathan tsit ha Jezreel gade ci gwanglu. Pe ngkwetpui pecu pwa cuhlu pak kerane. Dede pa pakla kecudau, Jonathan napei kau miedi delwe pepi siadi. Pe zi cai Mephibosheth.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Cine Beerothme pei Rimmon napei kena, Recab nah Baanah, Ishbosheth kiga tingna tinglum peri tetmie, pa tingna tingding mtak kebam dau. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Kikam ga kwa kebam pui de ziangmui miedi wheat tei mci kebam dau, nah Recab nah Baanah sünne eh tet nlüt lu nah pecu kahpet. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Iciu eh penai kilung ga nlüt luge, penai pecu ketang nah pecu teitset di pa pe zeubung ga pe zeulie ga zeu bam ge. Pecai penai pe peu danglu nah cide pung tetti, tingmui lampuiki ga tetcang Arabah ga gwang kerane. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Penai Ishbosheth peu pwa Hebron ga David da gwang, nah penai hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Ainie, aide Ishbosheth Saul napei peuda, n ngauraube, n teilung keu kera peei kelabe. Henai RAMPAUBE anui mpaube hegwangpei kum teibeu da Saul nah pe leuhme dade.” <verse eid="2SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Recab nah pe sinabe Baanah dage David sam keligai, Rimmon Beerothme pei napei kena; pa penai dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ringkela nzwa, makehung leune gade a mapie beu kelabe, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />mige a dage rang kecudau, ‘Pielo, Saul au tsai dida,’ pa samkeyi punggwang beula lie mning eh, Ih pecu nimlu nah Ziklag gade pecu teitset di. Pe samlia de ziemne Ih cipau ziehi de pecu peu. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Dai kieege si lai, mina kesiame ne pemau kegahme de pe kilung ga pe zeu gade teitset di kecudau, Ih cu pejai de nnai ba gade keu kerabe meni, nah nnaide kideu gade keu mzia kera?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Pecai David rehangmedung dage aja kaigai, nah penui penaide teitset di eh penai badung nah penai pi danglu eh Hebron ga tekwaki ge taiga keukezu gaidi. Dede penui Ishbosheth peu pwalu nah cide Hebron ga Abner rau gage kungdi.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">David ne Israel gwangpei tei kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Pecai Israel leuhme pelane Hebron ga David da gwang nah rangdi, “Pielo, anui au n teih n jai lie. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Nda gwang kedi lebie, Saul anui reu hegwang tei kebam dau, nangne Israel reugwame de teuswa beu. RAMPAUBE n dage rangdi, ‘Nang a minadung Israelme meurün kekwabe zie, nah nang Israelme reu muiteu tei zie.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:71">Lei. 78:71</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Cine Israel hangkiamedung pelane Hebron ga hegwangpei da gwang, nah hegwangpei David penuide ngngwa samting samkak lu RAMPAUBE dwade. Penui David de keniaklu Israelme reu hegwang tei kera. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />David mmi camrei kedidau pa hegwang tei ndeulu, nah pa mmi riakdai ge hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Pa Hebron ga Judahme reu mmi hena nah kei herok hegwang tei, nah Jerusalem ga pa mmi camreiekecum Israelme pelane nah Judahme reu hegwang tei.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">David Jerusalem gwakelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Hegwangpei nah pe minadung, hangdeu cika lungh kebamme Jebusime de renia kerane Jerusalem ga miedi. Penui David dage rangdi, “Nang aika gwang gailak miakcietme nah pisiame ne de ncu gwa gidi lubui. David aika gwang gailak.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Iciuliede, David Zion kengkiengbam de tuilu, nah cu cide David namdi tei dida. <verse eid="2SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Cidau David rangdi, “Caugame Jebusime de gwaketang bi, hangdeukang duilwa kebam gade ‘pisiame nah miakcitme’ David ngauraume da gwang cang kera mie zie.” Ciziemne mina rangla, “‘Miakcitme nah pisiame’ hegwangki ga lüt lak.” <verse eid="2SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Cine David kengkiengbam ga lunghdi, nah cide David namdi de eh qu di. Pa herieki rie twagwa di, petwang gade pelung lebie de. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />David ngkieng sütdi kedanemene RAMPAUBE, Tinggwang ngkiengtube pecu ngngwa kelane.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Pecai Hiram Tyre ga hegwangpei samgwame de David dage langgai, nah cedar tsingbang, tsingtaketeime, nah tangtsutaketeime de si eh. Penui David ziemne ki ge teilu. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />David RAMPAUBE ne pecu Israelme reu hegwang teibeu kecu cibam, nah pa pe hegwangram teindu kebeu pe minadung Israelme ziemne.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />David Hebron pütkedi cai Jerusalem ga gwanglu, pa nauseupuidung nah pe naudung luu silu Jerusalem gade, nah pa pe napei nah pe napuidung lungh silu. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Aidungde pe namedung zidung da Jerusalem gade pa lungh kelume: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 14:4">1 Hel. 14:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishama, Eliada, nah Eliphelet.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">David ne Philistinme de ngamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Cu Philistinme David de Israelme reu hegwang tei kera keniak kelu ha siulu ge, penui pelane tetpet pecu peei. Dede David cide siulu delwe kengkiengbam ga nghung di. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Cu Philistinmedung gwanglu nah Rephaim langkie ga gwang bam kwa di. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Pecai David RAMPAUBE dade kengha kiegai. Pa rangdi, “Ih Philistinmedung de ketang zie ni? Nang acu penui reu peu ngkienglu zieni?” RAMPAUBE ranggai David dage, “Ketang cu, kedanemene Ih ncu Philistinme reu peu ngkieng bi luzie.” <verse eid="2SA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Cine David penuide Baal Perazim gade ketang nah pa penuide cikade ngamlu. Pa sam kaigai, “RAMPAUBE a dwaga a ngauraume da lüt dui kedi nswak kela nzwa.” Cine cipau bam de de Baal Perazim teidi. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Philistinmedung penui rabe miedung cika ge gidi, nah David nah pe minadung cidungde keu tetdi.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Pecai Philistinmedung nghang dailu nah Rephaim chabak ga tetzang gai dailu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Cine David RAMPAUBE dade kengha kiedai gai, nah RAMPAUBE peda rang eh, “Nang penui dwale de ketang so, dede penuide pecaile de nggoi tegwalu nah penuide ketanglu balsam bangdung lebie de. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Nang mina lüt kela kwa tingkai gui kebam balsam tsingbang tün gade siu keludau, cidau kengkieng teu ketanglu. Aide teilu kedanemene RAMPAUBE n dwaga mie nswa ladi delu Philistinmedung reugwame de ketang kera.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Cine David RAMPAUBE pecu rang kebeu nzwa teilu. Pa Philistinmedung de Geba gade Gezer tetgwang cu kecang teitset.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Samkakbung de Jerusalem ga keugwang kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Cu David Israelme kedet kelumedung pelane de hekwa dailu, cang camrei gede. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />David cuhlu delwe pe mina pelane pecu ngngwa kelame de ngngwa miedi, Judah deu ga Baalah gade, Tinggwang samkakbung, Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE zi gade qu kelade, cherubim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cherubim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pe hesiu kepung kaune.</char></note> reu hegwang tei kebambe, cikade pung nghanglu kerane. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Penui Tinggwang samkakbung gari keheci gage kailu. Penui Abinadab ki, hangdeutu ga kebam de gade pwa mpet lu. Pe napei kena, Uzzah nah Ahio, hekwengari keheci lampui saulia la. <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />Abinadab ki hangdeutu ga kebam de gade gari ga Tinggwang samkakbung kai pwa kebam de teu mpet lu. Ahio ne samkakbung dwaga tet la. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Cidau David nah Israel kilungme pelane RAMPAUBE dwa gade lei tei nah lim cuhdi, tsing leibung, leibungdung, lyredung, tambourinedung, kehediang, nah ntwaidung kwa renga eh. <verse eid="2SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Penui Nakon gu hecaipung ga gwang keludau, hetumseu kaumie di, nah Uzzah peba nzangpet lwe Tinggwang samkakbung de herak kera tei, nah pa cide herak ludi. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Uzzah de pe rata sütdi. Tinggwang pemau ziemne pecu cikade ketang. Uzzah cika Tinggwang samkakbung taiga de tsaidi. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />David perata di kedanemene RAMPAUBE Uzzah de ketang kecune, nah pa cipau bamde zi Perez Uzzah qulu. Cipau bam de henai kecang de Perez Uzzah lie qula. <verse eid="2SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Cipaunai David RAMPAUBE de hingdi. Pa rangdi, “Dainzwa Tinggwang samkakbung de ada gwanglu lai?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Cine David RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pe taiga teugwang neu ma David namdi lung ga. Meliene, pa cide Gittitme pei Obed Edom ki gage pwa mpet kaidi. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />RAMPAUBE samkakbung Gittitme pei Obed Edom ki ga kei cum ge ziemne bamdi. Cine RAMPAUBE pecu nah pe kelak pelane de samlam beu. <verse eid="2SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Cu hegwangpei David da sam gwangdi, “RAMPAUBE ne Obed Edom ki nah peda kebam mapelane samlam beu Tinggwang samkakbung de ziemne.” Cine David mielu nah Obed Edom ki gade Tinggwang samkakbung de David namdi ga pung gwanglu pe suiyi eh. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />RAMPAUBE samkakbung pung kelame pikiet herok tetpet kedi cai, pa hetumseu nah hetumna pelui keyi ge ratak teigai. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />David pe kengking pelane teu RAMPAUBE dwa gade helim lim; pa linen hekeutupai nage rünne bahla. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Iciu eh David nah Israel leuhme pelane sah eh telui kwa eh RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pung gwanglu. <verse eid="2SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />RAMPAUBE samkakbung de David namdi ga pung gwang kela dau, Michal, Saul napui, hebaki gade pie mpet. Pa hegwangpei David RAMPAUBE dwaga nsau eh helim lim kebam ngaulu. Ge pa pecu pesuilu ma pe mlung gade. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Penui RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pung gwanglu eh pebam gage kaidi, paiki sum ga David cide ziemne mteipwa kebam ga. Pecai David keru reca nah kekangbau recadung RAMPAUBE dwa ga pwapeu. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Cidau David keru recadung nah kekangbau recadung ratakdung teicangdi ge, pa kengkieng RAMPAUBE zi gade minadung de samlam beu. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Pecai pa mina pelane de mzi beu, Israelme kekiee ge kebam leune de, mipei nah mipui dede, tangkukwak ge, heteih kang ge, nah kubetsi kekibe tangku. Ge mina pelane tetdi; migege kecu penui kiga cailigwang di. <verse eid="2SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Pecai David pe kilungme de samlam beu kera cailigwanglu. Saul napui, Michal David de redau kera tet petlu delwe rangdi, “Israel gwangpei henai pezi kedige teilu da, pe kilamedung hebaang releimedung miakngau gade henai pekatei pecu tei paula gaida, mige pezai kemlame ge ngngam mezing eh pekatei pecu tei paula kegai nzwa!” <verse eid="2SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />David Michal dage rangdi, “Ih cide RAMPAUBE dwa gage teigai, n pei nah pe kilungme pelane reu acu kedet kelube, RAMPAUBE minadung reu, Israelme reu acu muiteu kedet kelube. RAMPAUBE dwa ga Ih a suiyi la zie! <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Ih aide swa hengam teisi lubui reu, nah Ih akatei a miak gade henah zie. Dede nang hebaang releimedung ha rang kebamme dade, Ih au hetwa pungzie.” <verse eid="2SA 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Cine Michal, Saul napui, pa ketsai benai kecang hena lungh luma.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang David dage sampet kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Cinzwadi eh hegwangpei David pe hegwang kiga lungh kelucai, nah RAMPAUBE pecu twagwa kebam pe ngauraumedung pelane dade kemtak pwa kepeucai, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />hegwangpei caihakecibe Nathan dage rangdi, “Ainie, Ih cedar le teikelu kiga lunghbam, dede Tinggwang samkakbung de au paiki sum ga bam.” <verse eid="2SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Cidau Nathan hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Miecu, nang n lungning be teilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ncu ngngwa lalu.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Dede cipau ziu RAMPAUBE Nathan da gwang eh sam ranggai: <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Mie delwe a kilabe David dage ranglo, ‘RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangzeu: Nang a ziemne lungh kera ki teibeu zie ni? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kedanemene Ih Israelme de Egypt gade ngngwa mpet kelu ting gade cu kecang heki ga lungh kemakne; meliene, Ih au paiki ge ga bam eh mbeuh pwala. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Ih Israelme pelane kakga ngngwa mbeuh kela heni pelane gade, Ih a mina Israelme de kekwa kedet kelu muiteume mige dade de Ih, “Daitei eh nnui acu cedar le ketei ki ge teibeu meno de eh mage de rang ni?”’ <verse eid="2SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />Cu cine, a kilabe David da ranglo, ‘Ainzwa reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rangzeu: Ih ncu renaam gade ngngwalu, meuründung cai sui kela gade, ciu eh nang a mina Israelme reu kedi teilu kerane. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Nang kemie leune ga Ih ncu ngngwa la. Ih n dwade n ngauraume pelane de ngkap dida. Cu au Ih n zi tei mdi beuzie, kideu ga mina ditume zidung nzwa. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Ih a mina Israelme ziemne heni ge kedet luzie nah penuide peu cika lungh zie, ciu eh penuikatei penui deu ga lungh lu kerane nah mina ne teikeherei sita dilu kerane. Mina pe zai kesiame penui pedwa dau nzwa penui de teikeherei sita dizie, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />Ih tutiakme de aja kai eh peu a minadung Israelme reu kedi ketei tingdau de teikeherei la kelade. Ih cu au n ngauraume pelane dade ncu kemtak peu zie. Ciu delwe, Ih, RAMPAUBE Ih nziemne ki ge teibeu zie lie n dage sampet gaila. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Nang n teilung ting cangdi de, nah n paume de ngngwa kung dide, Ih n leuhme gede n caiga teucuh beu zie, pa n pum gade lungh gwang zie, nah Ih pe hegwangram tei ngkieng beuzie. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Pa a zi ziemne ki ge tei beu zie, nah Ih pe hegwangram kedibam kelungta bam kera teibeu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:5">1 Heg. 5:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Ih pe pei tei zie nah pa a napei tei zie. Pa kemaudung ketei dau, Ih pecu mina tuitie le nah mina pe na de kedap tsingria le ledeu zie. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Dede a samkakkelu samsang, Ih Saul n dwa gade keu mpet kedibe dade cide keu kedi de, pecu gidi lak. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />N leuhme nah hegwangram de kelungta n dwa bammui zie. N hegwangbam de kelungta bam zie.’” <verse eid="2SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Nathan David dage marang delwe sam aidung de pelane pecu paulia beu, nah pa pecu marengei peciakne ha ranglia beudi.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Cidau hegwangpei David lütlu nah RAMPAUBE dwa ga bamlu delwe rangdi, “Ih cau no RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, nah a kelak dai no, nang aikenzwa kecang ga acu ngngwa beu kera? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Cu aide au n dwade ma keceu nage, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang. Nang n kilabe kelak gwang dai kera kekiee ge ha de rang gaida, nah gwang dai kera ceheudung acu keulia da, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Ih David n dage daipai rang si lai no? Nang n kilabe de cila, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />N sam de ziemne, nah n katei n mariem de teilu kera ziemne, nang aipau kedi de teigai nah n kilabe de cide peu ciluda. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Cide ziemne nang au dizu, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, kedanemene migede nang kenzwa gah, nah nang gwale Tinggwang keda gah, anui anuikatei anui kwen le siu kelu nzwa. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />N mina Israelme nzwa daipai leuh gede bam no, kideu gade heleuh ge nang, Tinggwang, mie delwe nkatei n ziemne kelikelu? Nang aide teigai iciu eh penuide peu n mina n gu teilu kerane, n zi tei lu kerane, delwe n deu ziemne makedi nah mimakecang batadung teilu kerane. Nang heleuhdung de nah penui rabedung de n mina, nang Egypt gade kelikelume dwa gade gwa gidi. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Nang kelungta Israelme de n mina teiluda, nah nang, RAMPAUBE, penui Tinggwang dida. <verse eid="2SA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />Cu cine, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, nang n kilabe nah pe kelak ziemne sampet kegai de kelungta teicang beula relie lo. Nang rang kebeu nzwa tei lulo. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Peu n zi kelungta di kelube tei lulo, ciu eh minadung, ‘Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE au Israel Tinggwang,’ de eh rang zie. Nah peu n kilabe David kediria de n dwa lamui lu. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Kedanemene nang, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, nang n kilabe dage pecu ki teibeu zielie keulia gaida. Cide ziemne Ih, n kilabe, Ih ku eh n dade kiela. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Cu, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, nang au Tinggwang; nah n samdung au nlum lubui, nah nang sampet keyi aide n kilabe dage teigai da. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Ciciucai cu, n kilabe kilungme de samlam beu kera peu n suiyi lulo, ciu eh cide n dwa gade kelungta peu bam jüja lu kerane. Kedanemene nang, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, ma aidungde ranggai da, nah n samlam gade n kilabe leuhme de kelungta samlam pungzie.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">David ngkieng keludung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Aipau cai matiemene David Philistinme de gwaketang nah penuide ngamlu. Cine David Metheg Ammah de Philistinme ne kezeupwa kebamde gade gumlu.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Pecai pa Moabme de ngamdi nah pe minadung de peu hangdeu ga penuide zeulwe maria teu mdet. Pa heria kena teitset kera mdet mpet nah ria ge peu ring bam kera. Cine Moabme David kilame teidi nah heraha pecu peu ndeudi.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Pecai David Zobah gwangpei Rehob napei Hadadezer de ngamlu, Hadadezer Euphrate reuki tai de pe kedi kezeu dailu kera mie keladau. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />David pe dade 1,700 bagidung nah hepi le ketetme cang ngkai de tuilu. David bagi hekwendung pelane pi tei telwa di, dede bagidung pehai ziemne hekwendung kainzeu lu. <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Damascus gade Aramme Zobah gwangpei Hadadezer de ngha zielie kegwang dau, David Aramme mina cang ngkaiekena gede teitsetdi. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Pecai David penui deu Damascus ga Aram gage reugwame ramzeukidung teigai lu nah Aramme pe kila teidi nah pe dage heraha kai ladi. RAMPAUBE David kemie leuga pecu ngkieng kelu peu. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Hadadezer kang ga kilamedung ne pungkela kecak geudung de David ne tuilwe Jerusalem ga cidungde punggwang di. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Hegwangpei David Hadadezer namdi gadung, Tebah nah Berothai gade hetageu kekieege keulu.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Hamath ga hegwangpei Tou, David Hadadezer reugwame pelane de ngamkedi siulu ge, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />Tou pe napei Hadoram de hegwangpei David Hadadezer reu ngkieng kelune pecu kelum gai delwe samlam beu kera langgai, Kedanemene David Hadadezer de de ngngwa hereu tei nah pecu ngam kelune, delwe kedanemene Hadadezer Tou de ngngwa ma kekieege hereu tei renia kecune. Hadoram kecak, rangkanggeu, nah hetageu le teikelu madung peda punggwang. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Hegwangpei David pa heleuhdung pelane de ngamkelu gade ngaukelu kecak nah rangkanggeu cidungde, RAMPAUBE de kereca ga teu kerane kai nzeudi, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Moab, Aram gade Ammon minadung, Philistinme, nah Amalek, Zobah gwangpei Rehob napei Hadadezer dade tuikelu hemadung pelane si eh.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />David Mcai Langkam gade Aramme, minadung cang kerei heset de ngam kelu gade pa cailigwang keludau, pezi mdu kidi. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Pa Edom deu pelane gage reugwame ramzeukidung teilu, nah Edomme pelane pe kilame teila di. RAMPAUBE David kemie leuga pecu ngkieng kelu peu.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kangga kedimedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />David Israel pelane reu kedi tei nah pa mina pelane dage mzui nah samsang eh penui reu kedi tei gwang. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Zeruiah napei Joab ne reugwame reu kedibe nah Ahilud napei Jehoshaphat ne keraube tei. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Ahitub napei Zadok nah Abiathar napei Ahimelech pe naine cingkupei nah Seraiah ne keraube tei. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Jehoiada napei Benaiah Kerethitme nah Pelethitme reu keteube nah David napeimedung cai hegwangpei kangga ga pepeu keteu ditume. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipau pedum de 1 Heleuhha 18:17 de pie hedalu: </char><char style="fqa">cai hegwangpei kangga ditume; </char> dede MT laisiu, <char style="fqa">cai cingkume, de eh bam. </char> </note><verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">David penai Mephibosheth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />David rangdi, “Saul kelak ga migede bang nzeu reuni, Jonathan ziemne Ih penui da a zai keyi liagai lu kera?” <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Saul kelak ga kilame mige cika pe zi Ziba bamla, nah penui pecu David dage qugai. Hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Nang Ziba deni?” Pa keligai, “Yeo. Ih au n kilabe lie.” <verse eid="2SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Cine hegwangpei rangdi, “Saul kelak ga migede bang nzeu meda ni, Ih Tinggwang ngaugia penui dage liagai lu kera?” Ziba hegwangpei dage keligai, “Jonathan cude pe napei ge bam, pa au pe pi telwa.” <verse eid="2SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Pa daiga lano?” Ziba hegwangpei dage keligai, “Pielo, pa au Lo Debar ga Ammiel napei Machir kiga bam lie.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Pecai hegwangpei David mide langgai eh pecu Lo Debar ga Ammiel napei Machir ki gade pecu ngngwa mpetlu. <verse eid="2SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Cine Mephibosheth Jonathan napei Saul napei, David da gwang eh David de kerüt gade pe zu hangdeu ga keumie. David rangdi, “Mephibosheth.” Pa keligai, “Ainie, Ih au n kilabe!” <verse eid="2SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />David pe dage rangdi, “Ngngi diso, kedanemene n pei Jonathan ziemne Ih n dade a zai keyi liagai bi zie, nah Ih ncu n pau Saul deu pelane peudai zie, nah nang kehei daude a taktyeibam gade matyei zie.” <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mephibosheth keumie lu delwe rangdi, “N kilabe cauge lie eh lano, Ih heteu ketsaibe kenzwa gede nang n zai keyi liagai kera?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Pecai hegwangpei Saul kilabe Ziba de qulu, delwe pe dage rangdi, “Saul nah pe kelak gu leune Ih n mpaube tsapei de peu dida. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Nang, n napeidung, nah n kilamedung pe ziemne heta ta maisia nah nang meidung luhlüt lu maisia iciu eh n mpaube tsapei tyei kera taktyeipok bam luzie. Kedanemene Mephibosheth, n mpaube tsapei, a taktyeibam gade tyei mui maisia.” Cu Ziba napei kereiehmengei nah kilame ngkai bam. <verse eid="2SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Pecai Ziba hegwangpei dage rangdi, “N kilabe a mpaube hegwangpei pe kilabe dage kerang pelane tei luzie.” Hegwangpei rangsi gai, “Mephibosheth ziemne au, pa a taktyeibam gade matyei zie, hegwangpei napeidung hangge nzwa.” <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mephibosheth napei rehang ge bamla pezi au Mika. Ziba ki ga kelungme pelane au Mephibosheth kilamedung. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Cine Mephibosheth Jerusalem ga lunghdi, nah pa hegwangpei taktyeibam gade matyei muila, pa au pe pi kena telwa liede.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">David Ammonme de ngamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Cinzwa eh matiemene Ammon leuhme gwangpei tsaidi, nah pe napei Hanun ne pe bam ga hegwang teidi. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />David rangdi, “Ih Nahash napei Hanun de ngaugia liagai zie, pe pei acu ngaugia lia kegai nzwa.” Cine David pe kilame de langgai Hanun lung taumla kera pe pei ha ziemne. Pe kilame Ammonme deu ga lütlu. <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />Dede Ammon leuhme muiteume penui mpaupei Hanun dage rangdi, “N lung taumla kerane pa minadung de n dage langkegai de ziemne nang David n pei de rütla lie eh cet kesang lani? David n dage pe kilamedung de peu namdibe pie kerane langgai meni, cide mcet eh, gwalu kerane?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Cine Hanun David kilamedung de tuilu, penui geitangmai pempie ge taidi, penui paini penui ndang kecang dangtüt di, delwe penuide langgi di. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Aide penui David dage rang kegaidau, pa penuide redau kera mipeidung langgai, minadung ngngam süt kedine. Hegwangpei rangdi, “Nnui geitangmai lungcuh dailu kemakta Jericho ga bamlu, delwe pecaine cailigwang lulo.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Ammonme penuide David ngkaukedi cilu ge, Ammon leuhmedung samgwamedung langgai eh Beth Rehob nah Zobah gade Aramme de, hepi reugwame mina cang ngkai, nah Maacah gwangpei mina cang ge de ngngwalu, nah Tobme mina cang kereiehkena de si eh lilu. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />David cide siulu ge, pa Joab nah reugwamaa pelane de langgai. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Ammonme tetpet eh penui namdibe rieki kimui ga hereu tei kera sapbia lu, cidau Zobah penai Rehob ga Aramme, nah Tob nah Maacah ga minadung, penuikatei hangdeu kemza ga saplu.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Joab hereu pedwale nah pecaile kenana lam pecu mcwa lwe sapbia kebam ngaulu ge, pa Israelme reugwa yitume kangge de kedet lu delwe Aramme de renia kera penui mteilu. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Kedame pe minadung de pwa pe sinabe Abishai ba gage kai beudi, delwe pa penuide Ammon reugwame de regi kera lang mpetlu. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Joab rangdi, “Aramme a ziemne ngkieng zu dicai, iciucai nang, Abishai, acu kelilu maisia. Dede Ammon reugwame au n ziemne ngkieng zu dicai, iciucai Ih gwang eh ncu kelilu zie. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Ngkieng lu, nah anuikatei anui minadung ziemne nah anui Tinggwang namdidung ziemne ngkieng lie kecu keulia gelo, RAMPAUBE au pe mariem ziemne keyibe teilu zie kecune.” <verse eid="2SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Cine Joab nah pe reugwame Aramme de hereu tei renia kera tetpet di, penuide Israel reugwame dwa gade gwaketang eh pak kecu teidi. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Ammon reugwame au Aramme pak kedi ngaulu ge, penui de Abishai dade pakdi nah namdibe ga caili nlütdi. Pecai Joab Ammonme minadung dade cailigwang lu nah Jerusalem ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Aramme Israelme ne penuide ngam kedi ngaulu ge, penuikatei gwang ngkwa dailu. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Pecai Hadarezer Euphrate Reuki gwale de Aramme reugwamaa de langgai. Penui Helam nah Shobak ga gwanglu, Hadarezer gu reugwame reu kedibe, penui dwa tetlu. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />David da aide ranglia kebeu dau, pa Israelme pelane de qu hekwalu, Jordan kahlu, nah Helam ga gwanglu. Aramme David de renia eh hereu maadung penuikatei mteilwe sapbia lu delwe pecu regi. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Arameanme au Israel dade pakdi, nah David au penui hekwen bagidung ga kela mina hai hena de nah hekwen keteume mina cang riakdai de teitsetdi. Shobak penui gu reugwamaa muibe de rejam di eh cikade tsaidi. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Hegwangme pelane Hadarezer kilamedung au penuide Israel ne ngamkedi ngaulu ge, penui Israelme de ngngwa kezuyi teilu delwe penui kangga kelungme teidi. Cine Aramme au Ammonme minadung de ngha si kera hingdi.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">David penai Bathsheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Heriakting gwang kezeudau, cipau tingdau hegwangmedung hereu ga miela, ciu eh David Joab, pe kilamedung nah Israel reugwame peciakne de langmpet gai. Penui Ammon reugwame de ngamlu delwe Rabbah de twagwalu. Dede David Jerusalem ga bamdi.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Cinzwa eh langnaige tinghegi David pe zeu gade cuhlu delwe pe hegwangki kinim ga tetpet. Cika de mipui ge duipia bam eh pa ngaulu, nah mipuibe de pie kegaidau hezu yisüt. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Cine David minadung de langgai eh cau cipau pui dede ci ziebi keteugai. Mige rang eh, “Bathsheba, Eliam napui meni aide, nah cipau pui de Hittitme Uriah nau meni?” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />David samgwame de langgai eh pecu ngngwalu; pa pe taiga gwang, nah pa pecu ngngwa zeudi (kedanemene pekatei pa mipui zai gade teimci lwe bam kecudau ge). Ciu eh pa pe ki cailigwang di. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Mipui be tetlak lu, nah pa mina langgai eh David dage ranggai; pa rangdi, “Ih au tetlak dida.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Ciu eh David Joab de langgai eh ranggai, “Hittitme pei Uriah de a dage langgai lo.” Cine Joab Uriah de David dage langgai. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uriah gwanglu ge, David pe dade Joab dainzwa no keteu, reugwame dainzwa bam bi, nah hereu be dainzwa pak bam bi kecu keteu. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />David Uriah dage rangdi, “N kiga nghung delwe n pi hui di.” Cine Uriah hegwang bam gade tetdi, nah Uriah tet kedi cai hegwangpei mapeu pe ziemne langgai. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Dede Uriah au hegwangpei ki kikam ga pe mpaube kilame pelane de ngngwa lwe zip bam, nah pa peki ga nghung mene bam. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Cidau penui David dage rangbeu, “Uriah peki ga nghung melie,” David Uriah dage rangdi, “Nang hebeuh tei eh gwang meni? Daitei nang n ki ga nghung me no?” <verse eid="2SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uriah David dage keligai, “Samkakbung, Israel nah Judah paikidung ga bam, nah a mpaube Joab nah a mpaube kilamedung hegwale heram zeula. Ciciucai Ih dainzwa a ki ga gwang tyeisak nah a nau de ngngwa zeu bam lulai? Nang ring kebamtane, Ih cide teilak.” <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Cine David Uriah dage rangdi, “Henai de aika bamlu reilo, nah ncünne ncu peu tet zie.” Cine Uriah cipaunai nah pecai benai de Jerusalem ga bamdi. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />David pecu qu kegai dau, pa pedwa gade tyei nah saklu, nah David peu pecu sakmie lu. Tinghegi dige Uriah pe ki ga nghung mene, pe mpaube kilamedung de ngngwa pe zeu ga pet zipdi.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Cine tingcang David laisiu raupwa Joab de peu, delwe Uriah ba gage langgai beu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />David laisiu raulu eh ainzwa ranggai, “Uriah de hereu hungtube dwa ge kailu, nah pe dade mdei dilu, ciu eh pecu teidi eh tsaidi lu kerane.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Cine Joab namdi tui pwa kebam de piegai delwe ngauraume ngkiengtu reugwame regi bam kera heni pa ci kebam gage Uriah de langgai. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Namdi ga minadung tetpet Joab reugwame de ngngwa keregi kecudau, David reugwamedung kangge kaudi, nah Hittitme pei Uriah dede cikade teitset di. <verse eid="2SA 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Joab hereu ga tei kedidung leune David dage sam lang kegaidau, <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />pa sam teu kegwangme dage aja kai eh ranggai, “Nang hegwangpei dage hereu ga matei kedidung pelane rang ciak kelu cai, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />cinzwa hegwangpei pe rata di eh n dage rang di lubui, ‘Daitei nang nggi kerane namdi taiga gwang nna no? Penui kirie gade kap kera nang ci meni? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Caune Abimelech napei Jerub-Besheth de teitset di no? Kirie nreule de mipuige ne keniak tangtsu pe reuga kelui mie meni, ciu eh pa Thebez gade tsaidi meni? Nnui daitei kirie be ga gwang nna no?’ Ciu eh n sam keli maisia, ‘N kilabe Hittitme pei Uriah de tsai dida.’”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Cine ma pelane tei kedidung de David de mie pau beu lo Joab pecu rang kebeu nzwa samgwabe langgai eh tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Pecai samgwabe David dage rangdi, “Kerai dau anui ngauraume be ngkieng ki lie, luh gade penui anui taiga gwang, dede anui penuide gwa caili pwa kirie ki kenlüt gage kai di. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Ge lakpi kekapme bau kirie gade n reugwamedung de kap, nah hegwangpei kilamedung kangge de teitsetdi, nah n kilabe Hittitme pei Uriah dede teitset dida.” <verse eid="2SA 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Pecai David samgwame dage rangdi, “Joab dage aide rangbeu lo, ‘Aide ne nsui teimsia so, kedanemene kingtie be hang gege de ngkap zie lu. Namdibe de nnui gwaketang reureulu, delwe cide tui lulo,’ nah pecu tei ngkuu gai.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Cine Uriah nau pe nahpei Uriah tsai kedi siu luge, pa pe nahpei ziemne pesui siasüt di. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Pe suisiet de cang dige, David pecu ngngwa lwe pe hegwangki ga gwanglu, nah pa pe naudi delwe pecu mipeina ge mna beu. Dede David tei kegai de RAMPAUBE pesui lu ma.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Nathan ne David de kesiu kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Cidau RAMPAUBE David dage Nathan de langgai. Pa peda gwang eh rangdi, “Piage namdi ge ga mipei hangna lungh bamla. Mipei hangge mahei nah kedabe maga. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Keheibe pei meuründung nah ketumdung kiee süt, <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />dede kegabe pei au meurün pui ket keceu nage gwale magede gah, pa cide luilu eh pepok tei nah ngkwet cuhlu. Cide pecu nah pe namedung de ngngwa eh lungh cuhlu. Meurünna de pecu ngngwa matyei nah pe piak gade de sak nsam la, nah cide pe ba ga zipla, nah pe dade pe napui nzwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Langnaige makeheibe pei da pe giame ge gwanglu, dede makeheibe pei de pe pok tei kerane ziemne pe kauhaudung nah ketumdung gade makaune ge de peu neu tadi. Meliene pa ma kegahbe pei gu meurünna de keulu delwe pe giabe ziemne cide lang beudi.” <verse eid="2SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />David makeheibe pei de pe rata sütdi, delwe pa Nathan dage pe rata süt gai, “RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, mina caube aikenzwa ta tei bi kecube de au ketsai gage kaidi kerabe nsam. <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Pa meurünna pia mdai kieege peu dai maisia kedanemene pa cikenzwa ta tei kedine, delwe kedanemene pa ma kegahbe de ngaunggia kemakne.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Cidau Nathan David dage rangdi, “Nang mina cipaude da! RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, rangzeu, ‘Israelme reu hegwang tei kerane Ih ncu keniak luda, nah Ih ncu Saul ba gade kelibeu. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Ih ncu n mpaube ki peudi, nah n mpaube naudung de n ba gage kaibeu. Ih ncu Israel nah Judah ki peudi. Dede magade cide ceu ham dicai, Ih ma kedadung de kaisi eh ncu peu lubui lie. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Cine nang daitei RAMPAUBE ajadung mlai lano, pe miakngau gade daitei kesiabe tei dino? Nang Hittitme pei Uriah de kingtie le tei kaudi nah n nau teikera penau de lu teudi. Nang Ammon reugwame kingtie pwa pecu teitsetdi. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Cine cu kingtie madaude n ki püt lak, kedanemene nang acu masipei mene Hittitme pei Uriah nau de n nau tei kelune.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />RAMPAUBE ranggai, ‘Pielo, Ih nkatei n ki gade ncu kekap teucuh beu zie da. N miak dwa gade, Ih n naudung de keulu eh n kidabe de peu dizie, nah ting baaha kecudau n naudung de pa ngngwa zeu zie. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Kedanemene nang n mau mbai eh teidi, dede Ih au Israelme pelane dwa gade ma aide tei zie, tingnaimiak kebaa gade.’” <verse eid="2SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Ciu eh David Nathan dade rangdi, “Ih RAMPAUBE dwa gade mau dida.” Nathan David de keligai, “RAMPAUBE de n mau gibeu da. Ncu teitsetdi lak. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Ciuliede, nang heta aide gade RAMPAUBE de mlai kedine, hena ncu mna kebeu nade tsai bizie.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Pecai Nathan tetdi nah kilung gwang di.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Uriah nau ne David de mna kebeu nade de RAMPAUBE mcaudi, nah pa mra sütdi. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />David pecai Tinggwang da henabe de ziemne kiebi di. David mmwang di nah kilung nlütlu delwe tingmuiziu pelane hangdeu ga zeudi. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Pe kiga hangkiamedung cuh lu eh petai ga sap bamdi, hangdeu gade pecu peu cuhlu kerane, dede pa cuh neu tadi, nah penuide ngngwa matyei tadi. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Cinzwadi eh hena nabe lang henane benai tsaidi. David kilamedung hena nabe tsaidi delie pe dage rang hingdi, kedanemene penui rangdi, “Pielo, hena nabe ring kebam dau anui pecu mpau da, nah pa anui kwa kingnei ma. Hena nabe tsaidi delie anui pe dage ranglia cai pa pekatei pecu dainzwa di laino?!” <verse eid="2SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Dede David pe kilamedung hangge dage ngkim resiu ncüt kebam ngau luge, David hena nabe tsaidi delie kecu ci di. Pa pe kilamedung dade rangdi, “Hena nabe tsaidi deni?” Penui keligai, “Pa tsai dida.” <verse eid="2SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Ciu eh David hangdeu gade cuhlu nah pekatei duipia lu, pekatei maca pütlu delwe penia releu lu. Pa RAMPAUBE de kerecaki ga mie di delwe cika de reca lu, nah pecai pe hegwangki ga pa caili gwanglu. Pa kie kegaidau, penui taktyei pe dwa gage kaibeu, nah pa tyeilu. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Pecai pe kilamedung pe dade rangdi, “Daitei nang ainzwa tei dino? Nang mmwang nah hap hena nabe ziemne pa ring kebam dau, dede hena nabe tsai dige, nang cuhlu delwe matyei.” <verse eid="2SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />David keligai, “Hena nabe ring kebam dau Ih mmwang nah hap. Ih rangdi, ‘Cau ci lu lai RAMPAUBE acu ngia beu zie mi lak bi, hena nabe ring lu kera?’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Dede cu au pa tsai dida, cine daitei Ih mmwang bam lai? Ih pecu keu cailigwang dailu bui ni? Ih peda mie zie, dede pa au ada cailigwang dai lak ta.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />David pe nau Bathsheba lung teinciep lu, nah peda gwang eh pecu ngngwa zeudi. Pecai pa mipeina gede mna lu, nah henanabe zi Solomon msiaklu. RAMPAUBE pecu hung<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:6">Mat. 1:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />nah pa cairasam kecibe Nathan dage sam langgai eh pezi Jedidiah msiak lulo beu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pecu hung kecune.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Cu au Joab Rabbah Ammonme de ngngwa regi, nah pa hegwang namdi de gwalu. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Cine Joab samgwame David dage langgai nah rangdi, “Ih Rabbah de ngngwa regi, nah Ih namdi dui kemzi de tui luda. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Cu ciziemne reugwame pelane de hekwalu nah maage tei eh namdi de tegwalu delwe cide tuilu, kedanemene magade Ih namdi de tuilu cai, cide a zi ga ladi zie.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ciu eh David reugwame pelane de hekwalu eh Rabbah ga miedi; pa namdi de ngngwa regi nah cide tuilu. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />David penui gwangpei peu gade hegwang peurwa keulu, cide kecak perüt talent ge, nah cika tangtsu pemi kehung gede la. Hegwang peurwa de David peu gage rwalu. Ciu eh pa namdi gade ma kekiee tui kelu pwa mpetlu. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Pa namdi ga kebam minadung de ngngwa mpetlu delwe penui kemei tei eh tsinggetdung, hegeu hepeidung, nah nreudung pwa eh peu heta tei; pa penuide peu tangtsu ta ketei ga liede heta tei. David Ammomme namdidung pelane de peu aipau ta de teilu. Pecai David nah reugwame pelane ngngwa Jerusalem ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amnon penai Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Cinzwadi eh aipaucai David napei, Amnon puiseu napui Tamar de nrai sütdi, pa au Absalom tipui kesangbe, David napei keda hangge. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Pe tipui Tamar ziemne Amnon mnunglu tadi nah pa nra di, pa au relei kemci puige, nah Amnon pecu magede teigai kelak nzwadi. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Dede Amnon pe zangme ge, David sinabe, Shimeah napei pezi Jonadab de kecu ge bam. Jonadab au mriak süt cu pei ge. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Jonadab Amnon dage rangdi, “Hegwang napei ge daitei nang tingcang ramsang n suisia bam no? A dage nang rang lak ni?” Cine Amnon pecu keligai, “Ih Tamar de nrai lie, a sinabe Absalom tipui de.” <verse eid="2SA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Pecai Jonadab pe dage rangdi, “Nzeu ga zeulu delwe mra kecu ciem teilu. N pei ncu pie kera gwang kecu dau, pe dade kielu, ‘Nang kehereide a tipui Tamar de a dage langgai beulo acu peu matyei kera pwapeu kerane nah cide a dwa gade langlu kera, ciude Ih cide ngaulu kerane nah pe ba gade tyei lu kerane?’” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Cine Amnon kemra ciem teilu delwe zeulu. Hegwangpei pecu pie kera gwang kecudau, Amnon Hegwangpei dade rang eh, “Kehereide a tipui Tamar de a dage langgai beu eh Ih nra kebam ziemne taktyei kesa a dwa gade telei lu kerane ciude Ih pe ba gade tyeilu kerane.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Cidau David pe hegwangki ga Tamar dage sam langgai eh ranggai, “Cu n heipei Amnon kiga mie cu delwe pe ziemne taktyei mteilu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Cine Tamar pe heipei Amnon kiga pa zeu kebam ga miedi. Pa tokkui keulu delwe pe miakngau gade cide henetlu nah tangku teilu, delwe pa cide rulu. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Pa tangku kerukwak pwalu eh tangku pecu peu, dede pa tyei tadi. Pecai Amnon cika kebam mina kedame dage ranggai, “Mina pelane de a taiga de lang gidi.” Cine pelane pe dade tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ciu eh Amnon Tamar dade rangdi, “Taktyei de a zeubung ga pwa lütlu ciu eh Ih n ba gade tyeilu kerane.” Cine Tamar pa teikelu tangku pwalu delwe pe heipei Amnon zeubung ga pwa gwang beu. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Pa taktyei peda pwa kegwang dau, pa pecu gieplu delwe pe dade rangdi, “Gwang lu, a tipoi acu ngngwa zeulu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Pa pe dage keligai, “Lak, a heibo, a kemei teiso, kedanemene Israel ga aikenzwa ta tei kerabe ma. Aikenzwa hengam ta tei so! <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Ih a hengam dainzwa tei nggah lu lai no? N ziemne dainzwa no? Nang au Israelme kakga de kemieme hangge nzwa dizie! Kehereide cu hegwangpei dade rang lulo, kedanemene pa acu n dade keu mbai di laklu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Ciuliede Amnon pe sam kingnei tadi, nah pa au peswa pa ngkieng gwa kecune, pa pe dade ngkinglu, delwe pa pecu ngngwa zeudi.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Pecai Amnon Tamar de ngkau sütdi. Pa pecu luu keneu swade pa pecu ngkau gwadi. Amnon pe dage rangdi, “Cuhlu delwe tetcu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Dede pa pecu keligai, “Lak! Kedanemene ma siasüt kecu aide nang a dage tei kegai swade nang acu langgi kecu au siagwa lie!” Dede Amnon pe sam kingnei ma. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Meliene, pa pe kilame de qulu delwe rangdi, “Aipau puide de a dade teu tetdi, nah pecu kikam ngkuinam di.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Ge pe kilabe pecu ngngwa mpetdi delwe pe cai gade kikam ngkuinam di. Tamar au yisüt kecu nia teula kedanemene hegwangme napui relei kemcime teu kelane. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Tamar pe peu gage mimüt kailu delwe pe nia hietdi. Pa pe ba pepeu gage kailu delwe tetdi, hap süt eh pa tetdi.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Absalom pe sinabe peda rang eh, “N heipei Amnon ncu ngngwa bam me ni? Dede cu zing delu, a tipoi. Pa au n heipei lu. Ma aide nlung gage kainzeu so.” Cine Tamar pe sinabe Absalom kiga pekatei lungh bamdi. <verse eid="2SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Dede hegwangpei David ma pelane siu luge, pa perata sütdi. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Absalom Amnon dage mage de rang ma, kedanemene Absalom pecu ngkau sütdi pa pe teipui Tamar dage heta aikenzwa ge teigai eh pecu hengam tei kegaine.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Absalom ne Amnon de teitset kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Mmi kena ge gwang cang kelu cai Absalom pe meurün mai kebietme Ephraim taiga Baal Hazor ga heta tei bam, nah Absalom hegwangpei napeime pelane de cika gwang lulo qugai. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Absalom hegwangpei da mie eh rangdi, “Cu pielu, n kilabe pe meurün mai kebietme bam dida. Kehereide peu hegwangpei nah pe kilamedung acu, n kilabe de ngngwa tetlo.” <verse eid="2SA 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Hegwangpei Absalom de keligai, “Lak, a napei, anui pelane mie lak kedanemene anui n püt teirüt zielu.” Absalom hegwangpei dade pe nggia kie bi di, dede pa au mie lak dedi, dede pa pecu pe samlam kaibeu. <verse eid="2SA 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Ciu eh Absalom rang eh, “Melie cai, kehereide a sinabe Amnon de peu anuide ngngwa mielo.” Cine hegwangpei pedade rang eh, “Daitei Amnon ncu ngngwa tet laino?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Absalom David dade kie ketang di, pa cine peu Amnon nah hegwangpei napeimedung pelane de ngngwa tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Absalom pe kilamedung de aja kai eh ranggai, “Kingnei sünne lu. Amnon zau sak lwe mie kedidau nah Ih nnui de, ‘Amnon de tei cu,’ de eh rang kegaidau, pecu teitset dilu. Ngngi diso. Ih nnuide aja kaibeu meni? Kuu nah lungdi lu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Cine Absalom kilamedung pa penuide aja kai kebeu de nzwa eh Amnon dage teigai di. Cidau hegwangpei napeimedung pelane cuhlu, delwe keheibe de pe hekwen reu cwalwe pakdi.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Cinzwa eh penui lampuiki ga keladau David da sam aide teugwang beu eh ranggai, “Absalom ne hegwangpei napeidung pelane de teitset dida, nah cika penui migede de bang meda.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Ciu eh hegwangpei cuhlu eh pe paidung hietdi, nah hangdeu ga zeu bamdi; pe kilamedung pelane cuh saplwe pecu ngngwa penui paidung hietdi. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />David sinabe, Shimeah napei Jonadab, keligai delwe rangdi, “A mpaupei de peu penui rehangmedung, hegwangpei napeimedung pelane de teitset di lie kecu peu nlum helo, kedanemene Amnon rünne tsai dilu. Absalom pe tipui Tamar dage Amnon hezai gi kah kedi benai gade aide riem teula dida. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Ciziemne peu a mpaube hegwangpei de pau kebeu aide peu pelung ga kaidi helo, ciu eh hegwangpei napeimedung pelane de tsaidi delie nlum kera, kedanemene Amnon rünne tsaidi lu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Absalom pak tetdi. Kilame ge pemiak ngang cu pie kebam dau pe dade naimiak kenlütle bie hangdeutu mbie lede mina kekiee gwang kela ngaulu. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Ciu eh Jonadab hegwangpei dage rang eh, “Pielo, hegwangpei napeimedung gwang lada. Cide au n kilame kerang nzwa.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Ciu eh pa marang cang kedi cai, hegwangpei napeimedung gwang canglu delwe penui kwadung cisüt eh hapdi. Hegwangpei nah pe kilamedung de hap sütdi.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Dede Absalom pak pwa Ammihud napei Talmai Geshur ga hegwangpei da miedi. David tingba ramsang pe napei ziemne hei eh hap bamdi. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Cine Absalom Geshur ga pak mie delwe mmi kecum pa cika bamdi. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Hegwangpei David Absalom de mie ngau kera regui di, kedanemene Amnon nah pe tsit de ziemne pelung taumla kelune.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Absalom Jerusalem ga cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Ge Zeruiah napei Joab hegwangpei Absalom de ngau neu kebam ci di. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Cine Joab Tekoa gage sam langgai nah kemteu pui gede peda ngngwa gwang beu. Pa pe dage rangdi, “Kehereide nang n suisia la kecu rehi teilu nah suisiet paini bahlu. Kehereide maca le ncu keniak diso, dede mipui peting ketie ge hei hapla kedime nzwa lulo. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Pecai hegwangpei da miecu delwe Ih ranglia lai eh kebam de pe dage rang beulu.” Cine Joab hegwangpei dage pa rang kera samdung de pe dage rangbeu.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Tekoa mepui de hegwangpei de kempau ge, pa hangdeu ga pe zu keumie lu delwe rangdi, “Acu nghalo, hegwangpei.” <verse eid="2SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Daipai teidi no?” Pa keli eh, “Kesang be au Ih au hemipui ge, nah a nahpei tsai dida. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Ih, n kilabe pui, a napei hangna bam, nah penai luh gade ngngwa keretei, nah cika penaide teuntsam kera migede gah di. Hangge pau ne kedabe de teidi delwe pecu teitsetdi. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Cu pautsana peciakne n kilabe pui de ngaurau cuh dida, nah penui rang eh, ‘Anui ba gage pesinabe de teitset kedibe de peulo, iciu eh anui pecu teitset dilu kerane, pe sinabe pa teitset kedibe kum peeilu kera.’ Cine Penui pehiak de liede tei ngkapdi zie da. Iciu eh a da regeu ru bang kebam nade de penui tei mmütdi zieda nah penui a nahpei ziemne pezi mede pe leuhme liede kideu reu gade tei nggah dizie da.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Cine hegwangpei mipui de rangdi, “N kiga gwangcu, nah Ih n ziemne mage teibeu kera rangbeu zie.” <verse eid="2SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Tekoa mepui de hegwangpei de keli eh, “A mpaupei, hegwangpei, kemau tei kedi püt de Ih nah a pei kelak de peu punglo. Hegwangpei nah pe hegwangbam au mzeu lie.” <verse eid="2SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Hegwangpei keli eh, “Keheibe de n dage mage de rang cai, pecu ada ngngwa gwanglu, nah pa madaude ncu tung sita dizie.” <verse eid="2SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Ge pa rangdi, “Kehereide, peu hegwangpei de RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang dage kielo, ciciude hekum peei kelame mide teitset sita dilu kerane, ciciu eh penui a napeide de teitset melu kerane.” Hegwangpei keli eh, “RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, n napei peutam kette hangdeu ga cakmie dilak.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Pecai mipuibe rangdi, “Kehereide peu n kilabe pui de a mpaube hegwangpei da sam rang silo.” Pa rangdi, “Ranggai cu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Cine mipuibe rangdi, “Nang daitei eh kemau bata ci kenzwa ge Tinggwang minadung dage teigai kera cet lano? Ma aide rang kegai gade, hegwangpei au mige kemaube nzwa dida, kedanemene hegwangpei pe napei gwagi kedibe de ngngwa cailigwang dai ma kecune. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Anui peciakne tsai kerabe da, nah anui au hangdeu gage dui ruigai kedibe nzwa da, cide rui hekwa dai gailak. Dede Tinggwang au keringria keuteu dilak; meliene, pa au peu pak kelame ziemne lampui peu ngau dai lwe gwang dai lula. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Cu ciciucai, Ih a mpaube hegwangpei da ma aidungde ranglai eh gwang kela au, kedanemene minadung ne acu keheu kedine. Cine n kilabe pui pekatei pecu rangdi, ‘Ih cu au hegwangpei de marang zieda. Hegwangpei pe kilabe pui kie kelade teibeu zie ha. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Hegwangpei a kwa kingneilu eh acu nah a napei de ket tei eh, Tinggwang ne anuide kepeu deu de gade, teitsetdi zielie kelame ba gade pe kilapui de kelibeu zie ha.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Ge n kilabe kekie tei eh, ‘RAMPAUBO, kehereide peu a mpaube hegwangpei sam de gade acu peu ziune lulo, kedanemene Tinggwang samgwame nzwa, a mpaube hegwangpei au kesiabe gade keyibe cet ntsam lubui.’ Peu RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de ncu ngngwa la kelube tei lulo.”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Ge hegwangpei keli eh mipuibe dage rangdi, “Kehereide Ih ncu keteu lai eh kebam de gade a dade magede mbai diso.” Mipui keli eh, “Peu a mpaube hegwangpei de cu maranglo.” <verse eid="2SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Hegwangpei rangdi, “Ma aidungde ga Joab bata ncu si eh la meni?” Mipui keli eh rang, “Nang ringkela nzwa, a mpaube hegwangpei, migede a mpaube hegwangpei keheibe rang kegai gade zetle ba mede hile ba de pak gailak. N kilabe Joab ne acu aja kaibeu nah n kilabe rang kegai gade acu ma aidungde rangbeulo paubeu. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />N kilabe Joab aide tei kegai au tei kebam makie de tei lilu kerane. A mpaube au maci, Tinggwang samgwame maci nzwa, nah pa hangdeu ga tei kelabe leune cila.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Cine hegwangpei Joab dage rangdi, “Cu pielo, ma aidungde Ih teigai zie. Ciciucai miecu, nah rehangbe Absalom de ngngwa cailigwang lu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Cine Joab hegwangpei de kerüt nah teikeherei delie eh pedwa hangdeu ga keumie. Joab rangdi, “Henai Ih n dwa gade n suibe teikelu n kilabe cilu da, a mpaube hegwangpei, pe kilabe kie kelade teibeu kelu gade.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Cine Joab cuhlu delwe Geshur ga miedi, nah Absalom de Jerusalem ga ngngwa cailigwang lu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Hegwangpei rangdi, “Peu pecu pe kiga cailigwang lu, dede pecu peu a zu ngau so.” Cine Absalom peki ga cailigwang di, dede peu hegwangpei zu ngau ma.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Cu Israel pelane ga migede pe rehang pekeyi de ziemne pe nsa kerang Absalom kenzwa bam ma. Pa pepeu gade pepi kecang magede cang kemak peda gah. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Pa pe peutam mmi ramsang kum kekamle biet la, kedanemene petam pe ziemne rüt di kelane, pa pe peutam de mdet la; cide perüt shekel hai na swa kieela, cide au hegwangpei kemdet zai gade mdetla. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Absalom dade mipeina hangcum nah mipuina hangge lunghlu, pezi becai Tamar. Pa au hezukeyi pui ge.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Absalom Jerusalem ga mmi kena cang lungh, hegwangpei zu ngau mene. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Ge Absalom Joab dage sam langgai, pecu hegwangpei da langgai kera, dede Joab peda gwang ma. Cine Absalom sam pekenabe pia de langgai, dede Joab cipau pia de gwang ma. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Cine Absalom pe kilamedung dage rangdi, “Ainie, Joab luh a luh taiga bam, nah cika pegu barley bam. Mie delwe cika ge mi twa gailo.” Cine Absalom kilamedung luh ga mie mi twa gai. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Ge Joab cuh delwe Absalom da pe kiga gwang, nah pe dage rangdi, “Daitei n kilamedung a luh gage mi twa gaino?” <verse eid="2SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Absalom Joab de keli eh, “Pielo, Ih n dage sam langgai eh ranggai, ‘Aika gwanglu iciu eh Ih peu ncu hegwangpei dage langgai eh rang zie, “Ih daitei Geshur gade gwang lano? Cika kebambe a ziemne yiki kera ge. Cine cu au acu peu hegwangpei zu pielo, nah Ih magade mau lacai, peu pecu acu teitset dilu.”’” <verse eid="2SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Cine Joab hegwangpei da mielu delwe pecu rangbeu. Hegwangpei Absalom de qu kegaidau, pa hegwangpei da gwanglu nah hegwangpei dwa hangdeu ga keumie nah hegwangpei Absalom de kemam gai.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Absalom ciemkesia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Cinzwa kedi cai, Absalom pekatei ziemne bagi ge nah hekwendung pekatei ziemne, nah mina riakngei pe dwa pak swa kera si eh mteilu. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Absalom cuh zilu delwe namdi kirieki de ga lampui kung ga mie sap bam dila. Mina keheibede ma kehebwak tei mcilu neu eh hegwangpei da gwang kecudau, Absalom pecu qulu delwe rangla, “Nang dai namdi gade gwang lano?” Ge minabe pesam kelila, “N kilabe au Israel leuhme ket paube gade lie.” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Cine Absalom pe dade rangla, “Pielo, n ha au yi nah petau bamda, dede cika n ha kingnei kera hegwangpei ding tei kebam mide gah.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Absalom rang si eh cu, “Ih hangdeu ga dai kenzwa gede tutiakpei lie neu no, ciciude mina leune ma kehebwak mede peziu rangneu kelabe ada gwang lubui, nah Ih pecu kemzeube peu lubui!”. <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Cine cinzwa eh mina keheibe de Absalom de rüt kera peda gwang ge, Absalom peba mzang pet pecu pwalu, delwe pecu kemamla. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Absalom Israelme kemzuibe peei eh hegwangpei da kegwangme leune dage ainzwa tei gaila. Cine Absalom Israelme dade penui suiyi lu.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Cinzwa eh mmi mdai cang kelu dau, Absalom hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Kehereide acu peu Hebron ga mie delwe Ih RAMPAUBE dage sampet kegai de tei lulo. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Kedanemene n kilabe Aram deu Geshur ga lungh keladau Ih sampet nzeu, rang eh, ‘RAMPAUBE acu Jerusalem ga ngngwa gwang dai kesang beu liecai, ciciucai Ih RAMPAUBE de reca zie.’” <verse eid="2SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Cine hegwangpei peda rangdi, “Lungciep teu eh miecu.” Cine Absalom cuhlu delwe Hebron ga miedi. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Dede Absalom Israel leuhme pelane dage aide rang beulo eh reketmedung de langgai, “Nnui telui kwa siulu herizi, ‘Absalom ne Hebron ga hegwangpei tei dida’ de eh nnui rang maisia.’” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Absalom penuide qu kegai ga mina haina ge Jerusalem gade pecu ngngwa tetti. Penui Absalom heciem riem teu kelade magede cimene penui penuilung keyi mning eh tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Cidau Absalom ratak teibam ge, pa Ahithophel de pe nam Giloh gade ngngwa gwang kera langgai. Pa au David keledeube. Absalom ngau kerau ciem de ngkieng cuhdi, kedanemene Absalom caisuime kiee reureu kedine.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">David paktet kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Samgwame ge David da gwang ranggai, “Israel ga mina mlungdung Absalom caisui dida.” <verse eid="2SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Cine David pe kilamedung Jerusalem ga pecu ngngwa kebamme pelane dage rangdi, “Cuhlu nah anui pak cugo, mecaige anui migede Absalom dade pak gailak. Zette tetdi kera mteilu, mecai pa aika kelwa gwang anuide ngamlu nah pa anui reu gage makesia teugwang zieda nah namdibe ga kingtie mui le gwaketang zie da.” <verse eid="2SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Hegwangpei kilamedung hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Pielo, n kilamedung anui mpaube hegwangpei makeheibe de cet eh teilu kera mtei luda.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Hegwangpei nah pe kilungme pelane pecai tetdi, dede hegwangpei nauseupui kerei gede hegwangki kwa kera kainzeu di. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Hegwangpei nah pe mina pelane pecai tet dicai, penui ki kamtu ga mtaklu. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Pe reugwame peciakne de pecu ngngwa tetcu, nah pe dwa ga Kerethitme peciakne, nah Pelethitme peciakne, nah Gittitme peciakne, mina hai herok Gath gade pe caisui kelame tetdi.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Ge hegwangpei Gittitme Ittai dage rangdi, “Nang daitei anui de ngngwa mie lano? Cailigwang cu delwe hegwangpei de ngngwa bamlu, kedanemene nang au sangme ge nah n nam gade sangme teila. Nang n bam ga cailigwang cu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Nang nziene tet kedine, Ih daitei ncu peu anui pelane reuga ngngwa huirwa la laino? Ih daiga mie lau bi kecu Ih de cima. Cine cailigwang cu delwe n maame de ngngwa caili dailu. Peu herüt nah masang de nda la lulo.” <verse eid="2SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Dede Ittai hegwangpei sam keli eh rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ringkela nzwa, nah a mpaube hegwangpei ringkela nzwa, kesang a mpaube hegwangpei kemie leune ga, n kilame de cika mie zie, cide pekie ring kebam mede ketsai kecang liede.” <verse eid="2SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Cine David Ittai dade rangdi, “Ciciucai tet gaicu, delwe anuide nzang jüja lu.” Cine Gittitme Ittai hegwangpei de ngngwa nah pe minadung pelane de nah pe kelakdung pelane pecu ngngwa kelame de nzang tetgai. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Mina pelane Kidron Langkam tetkah kecudau nah hegwangpei pekatei de si eh tet kah kegwang dau, deudi pelane sahbak eh hapdi. Mina pelane hetaideu lebie lampui gage tetgai di.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Zadok de Levime pelane de ngngwa Tinggwang samkakbung de pwa lwe, cika la. Penui Tinggwang samkakbung de heu ngkeilu nah cidau Abiathar de penuide ncütlu. Mina pelane namdi de gade tetkah di kemaktane penui kwabam. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Hegwangpei Zadok dage rangdi, “Tinggwang samkakbung de namdi gage pwa caili gaidi. Ih RAMPAUBE miakngau gade pe suibe teilu liecai, pa acu aika ngngwa cailigwang dai zie nah samkakbung de nah pa lungh kebam ni de keulia dai zie. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Dede pa magade, ‘Ih au ncu a suilu ma,’ de eh rang cai, pielo, Ih aika bam, peu pecu a dage makeheibe de pe suibe teigai lulo.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Hegwangpei cingkupei Zadok dage rang si eh, “Nang caihakecibe meni? Nnai napei kena de nnai ngngwa lwe namdi ga helung nciep eh cailigwang lu, n napei Ahimaaz nah, nah Abiathar napei Jonathan. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Pielo, acu rangbeu kera nnai dade sam gwang kemaktane Ih Arabah ga kereuki kahpet kera ga kwabam luzie.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Cine Zadok penai Abiathar Tinggwang samkakbung de pwa Jerusalem ga cailigwang eh penai cika bamdi.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Dede David pe picum pung mene nah hap eh Olive Deutu ga hangdi, nah pa pepeu hezui lu. Pecu nzang kela mina leune pe peu hezuilu, nah penui hap jüja eh tet hangdi. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Mige David dage rangdi, “Ahithophel Absalom renia kela ga sila.” Cine David kie eh cu, “O RAMPAUBO, kehereide Ahithophel keledeu de kemta tei dilo.” <verse eid="2SA 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Cinzwa eh David lampuiki nreutu gade Tinggwang de reca kela ga gwangcang keludau, Arkitme Hushai pepai hietdi nah pepeu gage tangdei kailwe pecu redau kera gwang. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />David pe dage rangdi, “Nang acu ngngwa hebeuh teicai, nang aziemne kehebwak ge zie. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Dede nang namdi ga cailigwang eh Absalom dage aide rang cai, ‘Hegwangpei, Ih n kilabe tei zie, Ih pedwa n pei kila tei kegwang nzwa, cu Ih n kilabe tei zie,’ Iciude nang a ziemne Ahithophel keledeu kepeube de tei kebwak dizie. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Cingkupei Zadok penai Abiathar ncu ngngwa bam lak ni? Ciude nang hegwangpei ki gade siu kelu leune, nang cingkume Zadok penai Abiathar dage cide rangbeu lu maisia. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Pielo penai napei hangna Ahimaaz, Zadok napei nah Jonathan, Abiathar napei, penaide ngngwa bam. Nnui siu kelu leune penai ba gade nnui a dage langgai lu maisia.” <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Cine David zangbe Hushai, Absalom gwang canglu eh namdibe ga gwanglu nah Jerusalem ga nlütdi.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">David penai Ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />David lamlwatu reu gade manage tet kahpet ge, Ziba Mephibosheth kilabe gada kena püt tei lwe ngngwa pecu redau; ci kena de reuga tangku kwak haina, kubetsi peu haige, tangzüttsi peu haige, nah teigeu zaula ge pungla. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Hegwangpei Ziba dade rangdi, “Nang ma aidungde daitei punggwang lano?” Ziba keli eh, “Gadhadung au hegwangpei kilungme de peu teu kerane, tangku nah tangzüttsi tangku be cai n minadung de peu tyei kerane nah zau au keheibede hetaideu gade leu kedime de peu sak kera lie.” <verse eid="2SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Hegwangpei rangdi, “Ciucai n mpaube tsapei daiga bam no?” Ziba hegwangpei sam keli eh, “Pielo, Pa au Jerusalem pecai ga bam dida, kedanemene, pa rang eh, ‘Henai Israelme a pei hegwangram acu pwapeu zie.’” <verse eid="2SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Ge hegwangpei Ziba dage rangdi, “Mephibosheth gu leune cu au ngu dida.” Ziba keli eh, “Hegwangpei, a mpaubo, Ih n da henah miela. Acu peu n miakngau gade n suiyibe tei kelube tei lulo!”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei ne David de reset kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Hegwangpei David Bahurim ga gwang keludau, Saul tsame gade, cika de mige Gera napei pezi cai Shimei pecu redau kera tetpet. Pa tetpet eh pecu reset jüja eh tetla. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Pa David de nah hegwangpei kang kedime peciakne de tangtsudung sam, reugwame nah pumkwame hegwangpei hile nah zetle la liede. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei pecu reset eh qugai, “Tetdi, aika de tetdi, kemau keteibe, nang mide dapketsetbe! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Saul kilungme pelane de teitset kedi ziemne RAMPAUBE n reuga saja peu bam dida, nang pe bam ga hegwang tei bam. RAMPAUBE hegwangram de n napei Absalom de pwapeu dida. Nang kap kera gwangla dida, nang au mide dapketsetbe kecune.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Ge Zeruiah napei Abishai, hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Daitei heteu ketsaibe aide de peu a mpaube hegwangpei de reset laino? Kehereide acu peu mie delwe pe peu dang dilo.” <verse eid="2SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Dede hegwangpei rangdi, “Zeruiah namedung, Ih nnuide daipai tei laino? Pa acu reset bam au zie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pe dade, ‘David de reset dilu’ de eh kerangne. Ciucai caune pecu ranglai no, ‘Nang daitei eh hegwangpei de reset bam no?’” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Cine David Abishai nah pe kilamedung pelane dage rangdi, “Ainie, a na, a pum gade mna kelu nade, acu teitsetdi lai eh bam dida, cine aipau Benjamin leuhme dai kenzwa gede cu acu tei ngkapdi neu bam reu no? Pecu kebwak helo delwe pecu peu reset bamlo, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne cide reset kera pe dage aja kaibeu delu. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />RAMPAUBE lungrei a reu gage kai kegai de ngaulu de cilak, delwe henai pa acu reset kela de ziemne makeyi pwapeu lubui.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Cine David nah pe minadung lampui ga pwa jüja la, cidau Shimei pe mbie ga lamlwatu ga tet hang jüja pecu reset nah tangtsudung nah tangdei pwa beulwa. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Pecai hegwangpei nah pecu ngngwa kelame pelane leudi, nah penui tingmui ziemne kemtak dau pa mtaklu.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hushai penai Ahithophel keledeusam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Absalom nah Israelme pecu ngngwa kelame pelane cai, penui Jerusalem ga gwanglu, nah Ahithophel pecu ngngwa la. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Cinzwa eh David zangpei Arkitme Hushai Absalom da gwanglu ge, Hushai Absalom dage rangdi, “Hegwangpei ring ketiebe teilo! Hegwangpei ring ketiebe teilo!” <verse eid="2SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Absalom Hushai dade rangdi, “Aide n zangbe dage n masang de ni? Nang daitei pecu nzang mie me no?” <verse eid="2SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai Absalom dage rangdi, “Ma! Cinzwa meliene, “RAMPAUBE ne nah mina aidungde ne nah Israelme pelane ne kedet kelube, cipau pei deda lie, Ih peda lamui zie, nah Ih pecu ngngwa bam zie. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Bamkap de, Ih dai kenzwame gwatei laino? Ih pe napei dwade hegwatei lak ni? Ih n pei dwa gade gwatei kecu nzwa eh, Ih n dwa gade gwatei zie.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Pecai Absalom, Ahithophel dage rangdi, “Anui daipai tei maisia bi anuide ranglia beulo.” <verse eid="2SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahithophel Absalom de keli eh, “N pei hebaang naudung pa hegwangki rengei kera püt kenzeudung da miecu, nah Israel pelane nang n pei ngaurau teila kedi siu luzie. Pecai ncu ngngwa kelame pelane ba ngkieng luzie.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Cine penui Absalom ziemne hegwangki peureu gage paiki ge limlu, nah Absalom Israelme pelane miakngau gade pepei kila naudung da gwang di. <verse eid="2SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Cu Ahithophel keledeu sam pa cidau kepeu au mige pekatei Tinggwang mui gade siu kelu nzwa. Cinzwa eh Ahithophel rang kebeu sam pelane David penai Absalom hangnana ne nzuilu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Cidau Ahithophel Absalom dage rangdi, “Cu acu peu mipei cang kereiehkena gede kedetlo, nah Ih heziu cuhlu delwe David de zuimie zie. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Pa leu nah mnei kebam dau Ih pecu gwaketang zie delwe pecu kehing le keheu zie. Mina pecu ngngwa kelame pak dizie nah Ih hegwangpei de rünne gwaketang dizie. <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />Ih mina peciakne de n dage ngngwa cailigwang beuzie, lakciubepui pe nahpei da kegwang nzwa, nah n kangga mina peciakne da lungciep bamzie.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Ahithophel rang kegai Absalom nah Israel muiteume peciakne penui suilu.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Ge Absalom rangdi, “Cu Arkitme Hushai de qu gai nah pa dai rang zie bi anui kingnei gai go.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai Absalom da gwanglu ge, Absalom pe dage ranglia Ahithophel rang kebeu sam de nah Hushai de keteu, “Anui Ahithophel rang kebeude tei zie ni? Mecaige, daitei zie bi nang anui dage ranggai lo.” <verse eid="2SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Cine Hushai Absalom dage rangdi, “Henaipia Ahithophel nnui de rang kebeu sam de yi ma.” <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Hushai rangsi gai, “Nang n pei nah pe minadung au hereu kengkiengme, nah penui au kuusüt bam, nah penui au hegum pui pe name de luh gade sütteu kedibe nzwa kecu cibam. N pei au reugwa tei kemnimme ge, pa heziu pe reugwame de ngngwa zip lak. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Pielo, Cu au pa tsupop kesa ge ga mede heni keda ge ga mbai bam lubui. Cidau n minadung kesa raitu gade gwaketang lüt eh penuide teitset kedi ainzwa gwang zie, cide keheibe de siu kela rang zie, ‘Absalom caisui kelame reugwamedung kakga daptset kedi teidi.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Pecai kuutu reugwamedung liede, penui mlung hingho mlung kenzwamedung de, ngngi dizie kedanemene Israel pelane n pei au kengkieng pei ge kecu ci kebamne, nah pe minadung pecu ngngwa kelame au ngkieng süt. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Cine Ih keledeu sam au nang Israelme peciakne, Dan gade Beersheba ga kecang, de n dage qu hekwalu maisia, jaaidi ga heciangdung kieege kebamde nzwa, nah nangne penui de hereu ga sau mie kerabe da. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Pecai anui gwang David keheiga la liede pecu peei luzie, nah anui hangdeu ga hezin keimie kela nzwa pecu gumlu zie. Anui pecu pekatei, mede pe minadung ket de de ring bam lak. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Pa namdi ge ga caili nlüt dicai, Israelme peciakne heria teugwang zie cipau namdi ga nah anui cide kereuki gage teingkau dizie, tangtsu keceuna gede cika ngausi tadi kemaktane.” <verse eid="2SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Ge Absalom nah Israelme rangdi, “Hushai Arkitme sam de au Ahithophel swa yiki.” RAMPAUBE Ahithophel ledeu kebeu sam keyi de luu kelak riemdi delu, ciu eh Absalom da kekap teugwanglu kerane.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Pecai Hushai cingkume Zadok penai Abiathar dage rangdi, “Ahithophel Absalom nah Israel muiteume de cinzwa eh rangbeu, dede Ih ma keda rangbeu. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Ciciucai cu, zette miecu nah David dage paubeu; pe dage rangbeu, ‘Heziu Arabah heni cipauga kereuki kekahdung ga ramzeuki tei so, dede keheiteide kahpet lulo, mecai hegwangpei minadung pecu ngngwa kelame pelane de si eh teitset dizie lu.’” <verse eid="2SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Cu Jonathan penai Ahimaaz Rogel duipwak ga bamlu. Kilapui ge penai da mie bamla nah penai daipai ci neubi rangbeu la, kedanemene penai namdi ga lüt kecu ngaudi kera kehing ziemne. Sam rang gwanglu de, cidau penai mie delwe Hegwangpei David de rangbeu kerabe. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Dede cu pia rehangna ge penaide ngaulu nah Absalom dage paubeu. Cine Jonathan penai Ahimaaz zette tetdi nah Bahurim ga mipei ge kiga gwanglu, pe kigu ga tekwa ge bamla, cipau ga penai nghungdi. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Mipeibe nau de tekwa gum de pwalu delwe tekwa cide peu gumdi, delwe cide pereu gage ciu pudi, cine migede Jonathan penai Ahimaaz tekwa lung ga bam kecu cilu ma. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Absalom maame cipau puide kiga gwanglu delwe rangdi, “Daiga Ahimaaz penai Jonathan bam no?” Cipau pui de penuide rangbeu, “Penai kereuki kahpet dida.” Cine Penui penaide peei twagwa gai kedi cai nah penaide ngaulu tadi, cine penui Jerusalem ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Cinzwa eh penui tet kedi cai Jonathan nah Ahimaaz tekwa be gade mpetlu. Penai hegwangpei David dage paubeu kera miedi; penai pe dade rangdi, “Cuhlu delwe dui reu zette kah petlu kedanemene Ahithophel n ha ketsamtsam ledeu beu bamdi delu.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Cidau David nah pecu nzang kelame minadung leune cuhlu, delwe penui Jordan kah mpetlu. Tingcang tingnaimiak tau lüt ge penui migede Jordan kah petlu kemak tei dima. <verse eid="2SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahithophel pe sam de mzui kemak ngaulu ge, pa pe gada reu nghang delwe tetdi. Pa pekatei pe namdi ga miedi, pe zai hadung de tei mdui lwe pekatei ngkak tsaidi. Ainzwa eh pa tsaidi nah pe kelak rau gage kungdi.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Pecai David Mahanaim ga gwanglu. Absalom ziemne au, pa nah Israelme pelane pecu ngngwa Jordan ga kah mpetlu. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Absalom Amasa de peu reugwame reu kedi teilu Joab keleu gade. Amasa cai Ishmaelme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Makecime Jether de kecude “Ishmaelme” de eh kesa Greekme laisiudung kehegwa ga kebam de nzwa, mede “Israelme” de eh kehegwa Hebrew laisiudung ga kebam nzwa zie bi de mzi pwa bam. Makecime kangge “Israelme” de kecude Hebrew gade rau mau kedibe mi de eh nlum bam. “Ishmaelme” de kecude Hebrew nah Greek laisiu kehegwa ga keula (1Heleuhha 2:17 gade de ngau lubui). </char></note>, Jether napei, Abigail de ngngwa kezeube de, pa cai Nahash napui nah Zeruiah sinapui, Joab pui. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Pecai Israelme nah Absalom Gilead deu gage ramzeuki teilu.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Cinzwa eh David Mahanaim ga gwang keludau, Ammonme deu Rabbah nam gade kegwangbe Nahash napei Shobi, nah Machir Ammiel napei Lo Debar gade kegwangbe, nah Barzillai Gileadme Rogelim gade kegwangbe, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />penui zeukam nah paibadung, hekwakdung nah tangdei lidung, nah wheat, barley tokkui, mei kerube, reteipi, lentil teugwangbeu, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />heliadui, macania, meuründung, nah tungdui mnwa, ciude David nah pecu nzang kelamedung de peu tyeilu kerane. Cipau minadung de rangdi, “Minadung au hetaideu ga mzeu, leu nah hereu la.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Absalom tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />David pecu ngngwa kelame reugwamedung de peilu nah penui reuga kedime pecang nah kedime pehai kedetlu. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Pecai David reugwamedung de langgai, zicum gade zige Joab kangga, nah keda maa kecumbe cai Joab sinabe Zeruiah napei Abishai kangga, nah cude keda maa kecumbe Gittitme pei Ittai kangga. Hegwangpei reugwamedung dade rangdi, “Ih akatei de nnuide ngngwa mie kesang zie.” <verse eid="2SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Dede penui rangdi, “Nang hereu ga mie kerabe ma, anui au pakdi lie de penui anui de ngaunggia lak mede anui pempie ge de tsaidi lie de penui ngaunggia lak lie. Dede nang au anui mina cang kerei ge swade yiki! Ciziemne nang namdi gade anuide kengha kera mtei kelube yiki zielie.” <verse eid="2SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Cine hegwangpei penuide keligai, “Ih tei beuzie ma keheibe de nnui ziemne yitu kerabe.” Hegwangpei namdi kirie ga saplu pe reugwamedung pelane kebam pehai nah pecang tet mpetdi. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Hegwangpei Joab, Abishai, nah Ittai de aja kaibeu eh ranggai, “A ziemne rehangbe Absalom dage kesia teigai so.” Ge mina maa peciakne hegwangpei kedimedung de Absalom ha aipau aja de rang kecu siulu.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Cine reugwame renam lebie ga mie eh; hereu de Ephraim gung gade Israelme de ngngwa keregi. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Cikade Israel reugwame de David reugwamedung dwa gade ngamlu; cide ngam msia süt kedi, cipaunai mina cang ngkai gede teitsetdi. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Hereu de renam lebie pelane zang tetdi, nah mina kekiee ge hereu gade swade hegung gade tsai kieedi.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Absalom David reugwamedung kangge de redau kera gwang. Absalom pegu hekwen kehenabe teula, nah hekwen kenabe mhu bang kedi ge tsingkiakdung kekiee ge kangga nlüt ge, Absalom peu tsingkiak gage rapwadi. Pa hangdeu nah ting kakga hezu pwabam di nah pa hekwen nabe pak jüja tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Mige cide ngau eh Joab dage paubeu, “Pielo, Ih Absalom de mhu bang gage hezu pwa bam eh ngau lie!” <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Joab mina de Absalom ha pecu paubeu kecube dage rangdi, “Ainie! Nang pecu ngauda! Daitei eh nang pecu hangdeu gage tei kau gaidi meno? Ih ne de ncu rangkanggeu kerei nah kiakang ge peu kera.” <verse eid="2SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Joab dage keligai minabe, “Magade Ih rangkanggeu shekel cang ge ngau liede, Ih a ba hegwangpei napei dage hwacu gailak, kedanemene anui pelane hegwangpei n dage, Abishai nah Ittai dage aja kaikebeu de siuda, ‘Mide rehangbe Absalom de tung helo’ de ranggai. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Magade Ih kenret zierang tei eh a teilung kerehim gage kaidi cai (nah hegwangpei dade magede mbai kecu gah), nang acu gidi lubui.” <verse eid="2SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Ge Joab rangdi, “Ih ncu kwa lakta.” Cine Joab pe ba ga hengei kecum pwalu, nah pa ring eh mhu bang ga nzu kebamdau cidungde Absalom pe mlung gage kuigai. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Pecai Joab reunet pwa kela rehangme hang kerei Absalom de twagwalu, pecu tei, delwe pecu teitsetdi.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Pecai Joab telui kwa gai, nah Joab reugwame de ngngwa mtak kedine, reugwame Israelme de gwa zui kela gade cailigwang di. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Penui Absalom pau pwalu delwe hegung ga hekwaki kecuk ge gage pecu kelien gaidi; penui tangtsudung kekieege kangga gage pe pau kungdi, Israelme peciakne, mina pelane pe ki riep gage pakgai kedidau. <verse eid="2SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Cu Absalom, pa ring kebamdau, pe ziemne hegwangpei chabak gage tsusum kedige tei nzeu, kedanemene pa rangdi, “Ih a na tei ma a zi kaiteu lalu kera.” Pa tsusum de pe zi cai leu eh msiaklu, nah cine henai kecang de cide Absalom de kensung bam de qula.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kehap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Pecai Zadok napei Ahimaaz rangdi, “Cu au acu peu RAMPAUBE dainzwa hegwangpei de pe ngauraume ba dade pecu kelilu dibi kecu samlia keyi teugwang lulo.” <verse eid="2SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Joab pecu keligai, “Nang henai samlia keyi teu kegwangbe lak; tingba keda dau ne nang cide teilu maisia. Nang henai samlia gede teu tet lak kedanemene hegwangpei napei tsai dilu.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Pecai Joab Cushme pei dade rangdi, “Mie, nang kengau de hegwangpei dage ranglia lu.” Cushme Joab de keumie eh pak tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Pecai Zadok napei Ahimaaz Joab dage rang dai, “Ma keheibe de teigwang liede, kehereide acu de peu pakmie Cushme pei caisui lo.” Joab keligai, “Daitei nang pak neu no, a na, samlia de ziemne ziehi gede ncu pwapeu kelak ngau eh”? <verse eid="2SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />“Keheitei liede,” Ahimaaz rang eh, “Ih pak zie.” Cine Joab pecu keligai, “Ciude miecu” debeu. Ge Ahimaaz langkie lampui ga pak kah gwangdi, ge Cushme de zuilu.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />David rieki helungbe penai hegwabe kakga ntum bam. Reketbe kirieki taiga herieki peureu ga nghanglu delwe ngang cuh piegai. Pa piegai ge, pa mige pekatei pak eh gwang nna kela ngau. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Reketbe hegwangpei de sahbak delwe paubeu. Ge hegwangpei rangdi, “Magade pa pekatei lacai, pe mui ga samlia keyi bam da.” Pak kelabe de gwang nna reureulu nah namdi taiga nnalu. <verse eid="2SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Pecai reketbe mi kedage pak kela ngau, nah pa kirie kekwabe de qulu; pa rangdi, “Pielo, cika mi kedage de pekatei pakla lie.” Hegwangpei keligai, “Pa de samlia keyi teugwang lada.” <verse eid="2SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Cine reketbe rangdi, “Mina dwaga pakla kecude Zadok napei Ahimaaz nzwa pakla kecu Ih cet.” Hegwangpei keligai, “Pa au mina keyi nah samlia keyi teugwang la.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Pecai Ahimaaz hegwangpei de qugai nah rangdi, “Ma pelane yi dida”. Pa pekatei hegwangpei dwaga pe zu hangdeu ga keumie lwe rang, “RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de peu samlam punglo! Pa a mpaube hegwangpei de ngaurau eh penui ba hwacu kela minadung reu ngkieng kelu peuda” dedi. <verse eid="2SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Cine hegwangpei sam keli, “Rehangbe Absalom kwak la mi?” Ahimaaz keligai, “Hegwangpei kilabe, Joab acu lang kegaidau, Ih ma kebwak süt kecu ge ngau, dede cide daipai bi Ih ci lama.” <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Ge hegwangpei rangdi, “nreu gwanglu delwe aika saplu.” Cine Ahimaaz nreu gwanglu, delwe saplu.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Pecai Cushme zette gwanglu delwe rangdi, “Samlia keyi ge a mpaube hegwangpei ziemne teugwang la, henai RAMPAUBE ncu ngaurau kelame pelane reu gade ngkieng kelu ncu peuda.” <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Ge hegwangpei Cushme dage rangdi, “Rehangbe Absalom kwak la mi?” Cushme pei de keligai, “A mpaube hegwangpei ngauraumedung, nah n dage kesia teigai kera ncu mlai kelame pelane de, peu cipau rehangbe dage teigai kedi nzwa teigai kerabe lie.” <verse eid="2SA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Pecai hegwangpei pe lung keherei sütdi, nah pa herieki reuga kilung ga nghang lwe hapdi. Pa kemie dau pa hapdi, “A napei Absalom, a napei, a napei Absalom! Ih n keleu gade Ih tsai lubui liecai, Absalom, a napei, a napei!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Joab dage rangbeu, “Pielo, hegwangpei Absalom ziemne hei eh hap bam dida.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Cine cipaunai ngkieng kelu suiyi de reugwame peciakne ziemne suisiet tingba ge teidi, kedanemene reugwame cipaunai, “Hegwangpei pe napei ziemne hei eh kebam,” de eh kerang de siu kelune. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Reugwame cipaunai mlei mezing namdi ga mbai nlütdi, minadung penui hereu gade pak kecudau ngngam eh mbaidi kelame nzwa. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Hegwangpei pezu gum lwe hap sahbak eh cu, “A na Absalom, Absalom, a na, a na!” <verse eid="2SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Pecai Joab kilung ga hegwangpei da nlütlu delwe pe dage rangdi, “Nang ne henai n reugwame zudung pelane de hengam teigai delie, n keringria, n napeidung nah n napuidung teilungdung, nah n naudung teilungdung, nah n hebaang naudung, <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />kedanemene nang au ncu ngaukeraume de kula, nah ncu kekume de nang ngkaula. Kedanemene nang henai n reugwame nah muiteumedung n ziemne magede melie cu keulia da. Ih henai nlum lie, magade Absalom ringbam cai, nah anui pelane tsai dicai, cide be nang n suiyiki kera. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Cu ciziemne nang cuhlu delwe mie eh n reugwame da sam keyi rang lulo, kedanemene Ih RAMPAUBE zi gade a sampet gaila, magade nang mie mecai, migede heziu n taiga bam lakta. Cide au n ziemne n rehang gade cu kecang makesia tei kegwang leune swade sia ki zie.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Cine hegwangpei cuhlu nah namdi kirie ga ntumlu, nah mileune dage rangbeu, “Pielo, hegwangpei kirie ga ntum bam,” nah mina pelane hegwangpei dwaga gwanglu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Cine Israelme, mina pelane pe kilung rip ga pak di. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Israel heleuhdung pelane ga mina pelane hangge gede ngngwa kesamlim di eh ranggai, “Hegwangpei anui ngauraume ba gade anuide kelibeu, nah pa anuide Philistinme ba gade kelibeu, dede cu au pa Absalom ziemne anui deu gade pak dida. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Absalom, anui ne anui reu ngkieng kera keniak kelube de, hereu gade tsai dida. Cine nang daitei hegwangpei de ngngwa cailigwang daikera ziemne magede rang meno?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Hegwangpei David cingkume Zadok penai Abiathar dage sam langgai eh ranggai, “Judah ga kecingme dage resiu eh ranglo, ‘Daitei hegwangpei de pe hegwangki ga ngngwa cailigwang dai cuga nnui kamtu no? Kedanemene Israel ga pelane reki kebam au hegwangpei lam sap, pecu pe hegwangki ga ngngwa gwang dai kerane? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Nnui au a siname, a teih nah a rah. Iciu cai daitei nnui hegwangpei de ngngwa gwang dai kera kamtu lai no?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Iciucai Amasa da ranglo, ‘Nang a teih nah a rah me ni? Nang magade Joab nding cu gade a reugwame reu kedibe teilu melie cai, Tinggwang de peu a reu gage hungsüt kecu ge teigai lulo.’” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Cine pa mipei ge tei eh Judah ga mina pelane lung tei nreulu. Penui hegwangpei da langgai eh rang, “Caililu, nang nah n minadung pelane.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Cine hegwangpei caili di nah Jordan ga gwangdi. Cu Judahme peidung Gilgal ga gwang hegwangpei de redau kera mie delwe hegwangpei de Jordan taiga ngngwa gwang kerane.<verse eid="2SA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">David Jerusalem ga cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Bahurim gade kegwang Benjamitme, Gera napei Shimei, Judahme peidung de ngngwa lwe hegwangpei David de redau kera zette hung. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Cika mina cang ge Benjamin leuhme gade pecu nzangla, nah Saul kilapei Ziba, nah pe na mipeina hang kereiehmengei nah kilame hang ngkai pecu ngngwa la. Penui hegwangpei dwa gade Jordan kahpet lu. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Penui hegwangpei kilungme de ngngwa mpet kera nah pe lungning keyibe keheibe tei kerane penui kahpet lu. Gera napei Shimei hegwangpei dwaga keumie lu pa Jordan kahpet kera dwa. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimei hegwangpei da rangdi, “A kedibo, a kedibe hegwangpei Jerusalem püt kedi benai n kilabe teimau kedi de acu mmau mede nsung helo. Kehereide peu hegwangpei de cide pelung ga cet sitalu. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kedanemene n kilabe Ih mau kedi cibam. Pielo, aide ziemne Ih henai keraibe tei eh gwang bam Joseph kilungme mtei ding tei eh a mpaube hegwangpei de redau kerane hung bam.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Dede Zeruiah napei Abishai pe sam keli nah rangdi, “Aide ziemne Shimei de teitset di kerabe meni, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE ne keniak kelube de reset kedine?” <verse eid="2SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Pecai David rangdi, “Ncu Ih keu daipai tei laino, nnui Zeruiah napeidung, nnui henai acu renia kelame teidi kecu? Henai Israel ga mipei keheibede de teitset dizie ni? Kedanemene henai Ih Israel reu hegwang lie kecu ci kemakne?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Cine hegwangpei Shimei dage rangdi, “Nang au tsai lak.” Cine hegwangpei peda pe sampet eh pe sam kaibeu.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Pecai Saul napei Mephibosheth hegwangpei de redau kera nghung. Pa hegwangpei tet kedibe nai gade pa kilung ga pe lungciep eh gwang kemaktane pa pepi hui ma, mede pe geitangmai tai ma, mede penia heta ma. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Cine pa Jerusalem gade hegwangpei de redau kera gwang kecudau, hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Mephibosheth dai ziemne nang acu nzang tet meno?” <verse eid="2SA 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Pa pe sam keligai, “A kedibo hegwangpei, a kilabe ne acu cwadi lie, kedanemene Ih rang eh, ‘Ih gada püt tei zie ciu eh Ih cide teu lwe hegwangpei de ngngwa tet zie, kedanemene n kilabe swah kecu ziemne.’ <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />A kilabe Ziba acu kesiudi, n kilabe, a kedibe hegwangpei de. Dede hegwangpei a kedibe au Tinggwang samgwame nzwa lie. Ciziemne, n miakngau gade keyibe tei lulo. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Kedanemene a pei kilungme pelane tsai kedime a kedibe hegwangpei dwa gade, dede nang au n kilabe de peu n taktyei bam gade ncu ngngwa taktyei kelame kebam ga kaibeu. Ciziemne Ih daipai nzeu ge bam nau Ih hegwangpei dage cude hapgai si kera?” <verse eid="2SA 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Pecai hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Daitei magede rangsi au no? Ih peu Ziba nah ncu de peu luhdung mzi kera cetlu da.” <verse eid="2SA 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Cine Mephibosheth hegwangpei sam keligai, “Yeo, peu pecu luu ciaklu, kedanemene a kedibe hegwangpei yi eh pe kilung gwang canglu delu.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Pecai Gileadme pei Barzillai pa hegwangpei de ngngwa Jordan kahpet kerane Rogelim gade nghung, nah pa hegwangpei de ngngwa Jordan kah pet. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Cu Barzillai hecing sütti, pa mmi riakheset di. Pa hegwang pei teumai kesiadung rengei beu pa Mahanaim ga kebam dau, kedanemene pa mahei süt kecume ge cune. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Hegwangpei Barzillai dage rangdi, “A taiga gwanglu, nah iciude Ih ncu a taiga Jerusalem ga bam kera n mapie beuzie.” <verse eid="2SA 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Barzillai hegwangpei sam keligai, “Zie daikieege a teilung ga bang bam reuno, Ih hegwangpei de ngngwa Jerusalem ga nghang kera? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Ih mmi riakheset dida. Ih keyi kesia ci ntsam lubui ni? N kilabe Ih ketyeibe mede Ih kesakbe nsi lubuini? Ih mipui lei ketei nah mipeidung lei ketei kwa siu dai lubui ni? Ciuciucai, daitei n kilabe a mpaube hegwangpei de teikeherei lai? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />N kilabe au hegwangpei de nzang delwe Jordan ga kah gwang neulie. Dai ziemne hegwangpei cikenzwa ziehi le a ziehi teibeu laino? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Kehereide peu n kilabe de kilung caili dai dilu, ciu eh Ih a namdi ga a pui a pei rau taiga de tsailu kerane. Dede pielo, aika n kilabe Kimham bam. Peu pecu a mpaube hegwangpei de nzang kah gwanglu, nah pe ziemne nangne yi kerabe tei lulo.” <verse eid="2SA 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Hegwangpei sam keligai, “Kimham acu ngngwa kah gwang zie, nah Ih pe ziemne n dade keyibe teibeu zie, nah nang a dade hengim kelabe, Ih cide n ziemne teibeu zie.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Pecai mina pelane Jordan kahpet lu, nah hegwangpei kah gwang, nah hegwangpei Barzillai de kemam gai nah pecu samlambeu. Pecai Barzillai pe kiga cailigwang di.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Cine hegwangpei Gilgal ga kah gwangdi, nah Kimham pecu ngngwa kah gwanglu. Judah reugwame pelane nah Israel reugwame pempie gene hegwangpei de nzang gwanglu. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Tiemene, Israel ga mipei pelane hegwangpei da gwang kecu teidi nah hegwangpei dade rangdi, “Dai ziemne anui siname, Judahme peidung, ncu rega teu tetdi no delwe hegwangpei nah pe kilungme de Jordan reu ga ngngwa gwang no, nah David minadung pelane pecu ngngwa lano?” <verse eid="2SA 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Cine Judahme peidung Israelme peidung dage sam keligai, “Cide pekie kedanemene hegwangpei anuide kenna mege kecu ziemne ni. Ciucai daitei nnui aide ziemne nnui rata au no? Anui hegwangpei ne pemi tei kera mage tyei dini? Pa anuide mapeudung peu ni?” <verse eid="2SA 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Israelme peidung Judahme peidung de sam keligai, “Anui heleuh kerei hegwangpei de kenna kecu bam, cine anui nang swade David de nna ki kecu bam. Iciucai daitei nnui anuide ngaurau lano? Anui hegwangpei de ngngwa gwang dai kera kerang de siu raitu meni?” Dede Judahme peidung samdung au Israelme peidung samdung swade sia gwadi.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba David de kemlai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Cipau heni de gade Benjamin leuhme pei ge Bikri napei Sheba ma kehebwak kauge bamla. Pa telui kwagai delwe rangdi, “David gu nzi ga anui qwa kette gah, mede Jesse napei mapwa gade anui qwa kette gah. Peu mina leune de penui ki, Israel ga cailigwang culo.” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Cine Israelme pelane David de pütti delwe Bikri napei Sheba caisui di. Dede Judah leuhmedung penui gwangpei caisui teune lu, Jordan gade tetpwa Jerusalem kecang gwang lu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />David Jerusalem ga pe hegwangki ga gwanglu ge, pa nauseupui hang kerei de hegwangki pie rengei kera kai nzeu kedidung de ngngwalu delwe kekwame ba gage kaidi. Pa penui teumai kesiadung pwa peu, dede pa penuide nkop zeu kecu tei tadi. Cine penui tsai kemaktane, hemipuidung nzwa baang pwa bam di.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Pecai hegwangpei Amasa dage rangdi, “Lang cumne kakga ge Judahme minadung de qu hekwa lulo; nah nangde aika bam bi maisia.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Cine Amasa Judahme de qu kera miedi, dede hegwangpei pe ziemne peting riet kebeu de pa gikah di. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Cine David Abishai dade rangdi, “Cu au Absalom swa de Bikri napei Sheba anuide tei keherei gwa zie da. N mpaube kilamedung nah a reugwamedung de ngngwa lu, delwe pecai gwa mie culo, mecai pa tsukwa namdidung ngau delwe anui dwade pak dizie lu.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Pecai Joab pe minadung nah kerethitme nah Pelethitme nah kengkieng reugwamedung pelane si lwe pecai pwa mie. Penui Jerusalem gade Bikri napei Sheba de gwa kerane tetdi. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Penui Gibeon ga kebam tangtsu kedi ga kebamdau, Amasa penuide redau kera gwanglu. Joab au reunetdung kailwe bam nah pe kiakang ga kingtie pebung gage kailwe ngkang pung la. Pa tetpet lage pe kingtie nhai miedi. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Cine Joab Amasa dage rangdi, “Nang yi lami, a sinabo?” Joab pe zetle bale Amasa geitangmai kerak lu pecu hemam gai kerane. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Amasa au Joab hile ba ga tangkane keula kecu ngauma. Joab Amasa za gage reugai pe lungnetdung hangdeu ga lwa petdi. Joab pecu tei si tadi, nah Amasa tsai di.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Cine Joab nah pe sinabe Abishai penai nzang Bikri napei Sheba de zui mie. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Pecai Joab maame hangge Amasa taiga sap eh cipau peide rangdi, “Cau Joab de pesui labi nah cau David kilam bi, cipaume de peu Joab caisui lulo.” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa paau pezai le zokpung eh lampui sum ga bamdi. Minadung pelane sap dungci kebam minabe ngaulu ge, Pa Amasa paau lampui gade pwa mpet luh gage kaidi. Pa paige keupwa pe reuga tap gaibeu, kedanemene pe taiga kegwang leune sap dungci eh bam kedine. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Amasa de lampui gade teu mpet kedi cai minadung pelane Bikri napei Sheba de gwa mie kerane Joab caisui tet dailu.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba Israel leuhme pelane ga tetka gwang eh Abel Beth Maacah kecang, nah Bikritme deu pelane ga, ngngwa ngkwa kebamme Sheba cai zui miedi. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Abel Beth Maacah gade penui pecu gwa canglu delwe pecu twagwa lu. Namdi ga kirie gage penui tui kera takswa dwalu. Joab de ngngwa kela reugwame pelane le kirie tei ngkau di kera dap msia cuhdi. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Pecai namdi cika makeci pui ge sahbak eh, “Kingnei gailo, kehereide kingnei gailo, Joab! A taiga gwang mna lulo ciude Ih ncu mpau lu kerane.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Cine Joab peda gwang nna lu, nah mipuibe rangdi, “Nang Joab de ni?” Pa keli gai, “Ih de lie.” Pecai pa peda ge rangdi, “N kilabe samdung kingnei gailo.” Pa keligai “Ih kingnei bamda.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Pecai pa rangdi, “Penui ndaa tingdau rangla, ‘Abel namdi gade keci kecet peei lulo,’ nah cipau macet dele maha de teicak di lubui. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Anui au namdi Israel gade lungciep nah samsang tube ge. Nang teimsia di kera tei kebam de au Israel ga namdi pui ge lie. Daitei nang RAMPAUBE mapwa de mnwa lu neu zeu no?” <verse eid="2SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Cine Joab keligai eh rangdi, “Aide lakzing, aiciu kecu Ih tei lakzing, Ih ngkapdi kera mede tei msiadi kera tei lak. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Cide au kesang ma. Dede hangdeutu deudi Ephraim ga kebam pezi Bikri napei Sheba, pa hegwangpei David reu gage peba hwa gai. Pecu rünne peu lulo, iciucai Ih namdi gade caili di zie.” Mipuibe Joab dade rangdi, “Pepeu herieki reu gade ncu keling gaibeu zie.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Pecai mipuibe pe maci teu mina pelane da miedi. Penui Bikri napei Sheba peu danglu delwe Joab dage keling gai beu. Iciu ge pa telui kwa gai nah Joab minadung namdi gade tetdi, mileune de pe kilung riep ga gwang daidi. Pecai Joab Jerusalem ga hegwangpei da cailigwang di.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Joab au Israel reugwame reu kedibe nah Jehoiada napei Benaiah be Kerethitme reu nah Pelethitme reu kedibe. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoniram mina kemei tei eh peu bata tei kelame reu kedibe, nah Ahilud napei Jehoshaphat ne keraube tei. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sheva cai keraube nah Zadok penai Abiathar cai cingkume. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Jairme pei Ira cai David kangga kedime ge.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Gibeonme hekumkepei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />David hegwang ketei tingdau mmi kecum ge herakum kum gwangdi, nah David RAMPAUBE dade aipau ha de keteu gai. Cine RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Aipau herakum nnui da gwang kecu au Saul nah pe kilungme mide teitset kedi ziemne lie, kedanemene pa Gibeonme de teitset di kecune.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Iciuge Gibeonme au Israelme ma; penui au Amoritme leuh bang bam kecumedung. Israelmedung penuide teitset lak lie eh reset beu da, dede Saul au Israelme nah Judah leuhme ziemne pelung pang kecune penuide teitset ciakdi kera tei cu. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Cine hegwangpei David ne Gibeonme de qu hekwalu delwe penui dage rangdi, “Ih nnui ziemne daipai tei beu lai no? Dainzwa de kemaudung rilu lai no, ciu de RAMPAUBE keyi nah sampetdung de mapwa minadung de samlam beulu kera?” <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Gibeonme pe dage keligai, “Aide au anui kakga rangkang geu mede kecak, mede Saul nah pe kilungme ha melie. Cinzwa anui Israelme migede de teitset di kera au melie.” David keligai, “Ih nnui ziemne daitei maisia lie nnui rang zeu no?” <verse eid="2SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Penui hegwangpei sam keligai, “Anuide teitset ciakdi kera ntei kecube pei de, anuide heciem kesia ndam gai, ciu eh anuide tei ngkapdi da nah Israelme rai lungga peu bam tadi kera tei kecu, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />peu pe leuhmedung gade minadung hang hena anui dage kaibeu lulo, nah anui penuide RAMPAUBE dwa gade RAMPAUBE ne kedet kelude Saul nam Gibeah gade gwaktset dizie.” Cine hegwangpei rangdi, “Ih penuide ncu peu zie.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Dede hegwangpei Saul capei Mephibosheth, Jonathan napei de bangbeu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE David nah Saul napei Jonathan kakga samkak pwa kebam ziemne. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Dede hegwangpei Aiah napui Rizpah napei kena de ngngwalu, pa ne Saul de mna kebeu napei kenade, pe napei kena zi be Armoni nah Mephibosheth; delwe David Saul napui Merab <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">Michal de bam, </char> dede 2SA 6:23 ga rangcu pa hename bam ma; mede Michal de Merab zi kedabe bam lubui. </note> Meholahme Barzillai napei Adriel de pane mna kelume hangmengei de ngngwa si lu. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Pa penuide Gibeonme ba gage kai beudi. Penui penuide lamlwatu RAMPAUBE dwade gwakdi, nah penui pelane hang hena tsai nsam di. Penuide lulwet tingdau, Barley mei luhlüt kendeu dau raitu benai ge gwak tsetdi.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Pecai Rizpah, Aiah napui, rosopai keulu delwe lamlwatu ketsai paaudung taiga mie pe ziemne kam lu, lulwet kerai gade gwang tinggim gade penui reu gage tingruigai cu kecang. Pa au tingba dau tinggim ruinedung nah tingmui dau renaam kaudung de peu ketsai paaudung de kebwak di ma. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Aiah napui Rizpah, Saul nauseupui teibam kecu de David dage pau cang gaibeu.<verse eid="2SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />Cine David mie Saul radung nah pe napei Jonathan radung Jabesh Gileadme Beth Shan nam sum gade rega pwa di kecume dade keulu, Philistinme ne penaide gwak kedi gade, Saul de Gilboa gade Philistinme ne teitset kedicai. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />David cika de Saul radung nah pe napei Jonathan radung keulu, nah penui mina hanghena gwaktset kedi radung de keu hekwa si lu. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Penui Saul nah pe napei Jonathan radung Benjamin me deudi Zela ga, pe pei Kish rau gage kungdi. Penui hegwangpei rang kebeudung teicang siak debeu. Pecai Tinggwang penui deu ziemne penui kekie teibeu.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philistinme de ngngwa hereuketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Pecai Philistinme Israelme de ngngwa hereu tei dai cuhdi. Cine David pe reugwame de nzang nghung delwe Philistinme de regi. David hereu tei kecune pa leu sütdi. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ishbi-Benob, pekau disüt kecume leuhme ge, pe ngei hetageu le tei kecuge, perüt shekel haicum ge nah pa au kingtie keheci ge pwa la David de teitset kera cet eh. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Dede Zeruiah napei Abishai ne David de kelilu, Philistinme de ngngwa regi delwe pecu teitset di. Pecai David minadung sampet eh pe dage ranggai eh, “Nang madaude anui de nzang hereu ga peu mie si lak ta, iciu de nang Israelme mitaubung tei mmüt dilak kerane.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Aipaucai iciu bam kecudau Gob ga Philistinme de ngngwa hereu tei cu dai di, cika Hushathitme Sibbekai Rephaim leuhme pei Saph de teitset di.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrew laisiudung kesa ga</char><char style="fqa">Gob</char> de kecu mene<char style="fqa">Gezeth </char> mede <char style="fqa">Gezer de kecude be bam </char> </note> <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Gob ga Philistinme de ngngwa hereu tei dai kecudau, Jair Bethlehemme pei napei Elhanan Gittitme pei Goliath de teitsetdi, pe ngeica deidakme deikim kenzwa ge. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Iciu kecudau hereu kedage Gath gade mipei ge pe ratie süt kecu kauge peba kenana ga pe zurang herok rok bam nah pepi kenana gade pe zurang herok rok pung, pelane ge ngkai eh mdai. Pa de Rephaim leuh gade lungh kegwang mege. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Pa Israelme de taksi gai ge Jonathan, David sinabe Shimeah napei ne pecu teitsetdi. <verse eid="2SA 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Aidung cai Gathme Rephaim leuhmedung, nah penui de David ba gade nah pe reugwamedung ba gade teitsetdi.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">David ketwa lei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />David RAMPAUBE pecu pe ngauraumedung pelane ba gade, nah Saul ba gade kelikebeu benai lei kie aidungde RAMPAUBE dage teigai. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Pa kiegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">“RAMPAUBE au a tsurakang, a msiu, acu kelikelube.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Tinggwang au a tsurakang. Ih peda msiu lula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Pa au a hegeu, a kelikelu kiibe, a kengkiengbam, nah a msiuki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">zaisiet gade acu kelikelube.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Ih RAMPAUBE de qu gaizie, pecu au hetwa peu bui siak lie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">nah acu a ngauraume dade kelilu zie.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Kedanemene ketsai cui acu twagwa kelu ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">nah kengkap dui lwa kebamdung acu kezui pwabam dida.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Sheol kangriadung acu twagwa luda;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">ketsai takdung acu keuh luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:3">Lei. 116:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />A rei gade Ih RAMPAUBE de qu gai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Ih a Tinggwang de qu gai;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">pa pe kerecaki gade a kwa siulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">nah Ih kengha kie kegaide pe kwen ga lüt lu.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Pecai kideube mlaidi nah mbeudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">Tinggimdung gu bangdwadung mbeudi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">nah cidungde teukecung di, kedanemene Tinggwang pe rata kedine.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Mika pe ngkieki gade mpet di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">nah heu kebam mi pe mui gade petdi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">Regeudung de cide ne rugai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 97:3">Lei. 97:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Pa tinggimdung ngkei gai delwe nghung lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">nah pe pi kangga muiting eh ladi.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Pa cherub reuga tet eh limla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">pecu tingkai hesiudung reuga ngaudi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">pa tingkai hesiudung reu ga limla de eh bam </char> </note><verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Pa kemui ge pwa paiki tei pecu twagwa lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">tingdung ga tingrui mwa kerütdung hekwalu.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Pe dwaga tingkehepik gade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">regeu mi cakmie.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />RAMPAUBE tinggimdung gade tingceugai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">Hutube sah gai.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Pa lakpitsidung kapgai eh pe ngauraume de teizangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">tinghepik miheudung nah penuide langgidi.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Pecai jaaidi rwakdung ngaudi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kideube bangdwadung mradi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">RAMPAUBE kesiu kegai gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">pe ngkieki taikegai cui gade.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Pa nreule de nghung canglu; pa acu pwalu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">Pa dui cui gade acu teu mpetlu.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Pa a ngaurau kengkiengme dade acu kelibeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">acu ngaurau kelame dade, kedanemene penui a ziemne ngkieng zu kedine.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Penui a rei tingba benai acu ngngwa renia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">dede RAMPAUBE au acu kenghabe.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Pa acu heni mzaha kecu gage de ngngwa mpet beu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">Pa acu kelilu kedanemene pa acu pesui kelune.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />RAMPAUBE a ziehi teibeu a kesamsang nzüt gade;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">pa acu teu cuhlu a ba kenci nzüt gade.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Kedanemene Ih RAMPAUBE lampuidung pwa kelune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">nah a Tinggwang dade nreu tet eh kemau tei dima.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Kedanemene Pe masang ajadung pelane a dwaga la kecune;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">pe zaidung ziemne au, Ih cidung gade nreu tetdi ma.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Ih pedwa gade de kemau de ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">nah Ih kemau gade acu kainzeu lu.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE a ziehi teibeu a kesamsang nzüt gade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">Ih pe dwa gade mci kebam nzüt gade.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Kesamsangme dade, nang n kesamsang keulia beu la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">kemau kegahbe dade, nang maulakemak keulia beu la.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Kemcime dade nang kemci keulia la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">dede nang au kenlienme dade nzai sia la.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Nang keherei kelame de keli beu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">dede ngang kelame de nang nsui la ma, nah nang penuide tei hena di la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:51">Luk. 1:51</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 1:52">52</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Nang au a mitaubung kecu ziemne, RAMPAUBO.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">RAMPAUBE a kemui de teimbaa beu la.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kedanemene n kengha gade Ih lampui kam kebamde reu pakkah lubui;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">a Tinggwang ziemne Ih herieki reu nsau kah lubui.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Tinggwang ziemne au, pe zaireli au yicang.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">RAMPAUBE sam au mci.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">Pa au pe dade nsiulu kelame leune ziemne au hegeu ge lie.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE gwale cau Tinggwang no,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">nah Tinggwang gwale caube tsurakang ge no?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Tinggwang au a kemsiube,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">nah pa kemau kegahme de pe lampui gage saugai beula.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Pa heti ge nzwa a pi peu pak mzet lula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">nah kideutu kehudung gage acu kaigai beula.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Pa hereu ziemne a baciem keteu beula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">nah a ba hetageu lakpi pwa kap lu kera.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Nang n kelikelu hegeu de acu peu dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">nah n suiyi dene acu tei di beu da.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Nang a kangga a pi ziemne heni kedi ge tei beu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">cine a pi nzüt dima.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Ih a ngauraume de zui mie nah penuide ngkapdi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">Ih penuide ngkapdi kemaktane caili nreu dima.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Ih penuide ngkap dida nah penuide kedeumie dida; penui cuh gailak da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">Penui a pi kangga kau zeu dida.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Nang a reu gage kengkieng kaibeu hereu ziemne kiakang ge nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">Nang acu renia kelame de a kang gage kai dida.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Nang peu a ngauraume de a dade pakdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">acu ngkau kelame de Ih ngkap dida.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Penui kengha sahgai, dede migede penui de kelibeu ma;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">penui RAMPAUBE dage sah gai, dede pa penuide samli peu ma.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Ih penuide kideu reuga rebui nzwa dap kecaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">Ih penuide puidi ga nyiasai nzwa penui reuga daucim.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Nang acu a minadung kesamlim gade de kelilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Nang acu heleuhdung peube nzwa kainzeu luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Ih cikemakme ge ne a gwateila.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Sangmedung de kemei tei eh peu a da keumie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">Penui a kwa siulu herizi, penui a samzai teila.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Sangmedung mbeu eh penui kengkieng bamdung gade mpet.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />RAMPAUBE ringla! Peu a tsura de twa lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Acu kelikelu tsura, Tinggwang de hetwa peu lo.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Tinggwang aide au a ziemne hekum tei kebeube,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">minadung de a kang gage kai kebeube.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Pa a ngauraumedung dade acu lungmpet beu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Kesang, nang ne acu renia kelame reu gage acu teucuh beu lie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Nang pezai kesiame dade acu kelibeu la.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Ciziemne Ih ncu hetwa peuzie, RAMPAUBO, heleuhdung kakga de;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">Ih n zi de ketwalei tei zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:49">Lei. 18:49</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Tinggwang ngkieng kelu kedi pwa pe hegwangpei de peula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">nah pa samkakkelu kesamsang de pegu keniak kelube de pwalia la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">David dage nah kelungta pe leuhme dage.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">David sam kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Cu aipau samdung de David sam kamtube da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">Jesse napei David</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">herüt peusüt kecube pei de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">Jacob Tinggwang ne keniak kelube de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">Israelme ziemne lei keyi mpwak kegaibe.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“RAMPAUBE rabe a dade marang gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">nah pe sam au a mleu ga la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:21">2 Pet. 1:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Israel Tinggwang marang gaida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Israel de Kegumbe a dade rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Mige masang eh mina peureu hegwang keteibe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Tinggwang mie hing eh hegwang keteibe,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />pa au hemwadung kega tingcang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">tingnaimiak kepet dau tingcang naimiak baa kebam nzwa zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">tingrui cai, cehei kerenube hangdeu gade lungmpet eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">tingnaimiak ne tau mzaipei kebam nzwa.<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Kesang, a kilungme Tinggwang dwade cinzwa meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Pa acu ngngwa kelungta bam kera samkak luda meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">sam kaigai nah sampet gileu gaikelak?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Pa a kelikelu tei ngkiee beu nah Ih luukeneu pelane teicang beu meluini?<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Dede kesiame leune au hetudung keling gidi kerabe nzwa zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">kedanemene migede cidung de heba le hekwa gailak.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Mina cide deu cume au</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">hegeu nia ge mede hengei tang teu maisia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Penui kebam gade penuide ru ngga dizie.’”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">David gu reugwame ngkiengtume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Aidungde David reugwa kengkiengme zidung: Hachmonme Jeshbaal ne reugwa kenlang mereu muiteube. Pa piage mina hai heset de teitsetdi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">Jeshbaal, </char> de mene <char style="fqa">Josheb-Basshebeth, </char> <char style="fqa">Jashobeam, </char> <char style="fqa">Ishbaal, </char> mede <char style="fqa">Ishbosheth </char> de eh bam. Aidungde peciakne de zi ge lubui bam. </note><verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Pa cai Ahohitme pei Dodai napei Eleazar, pa de kengkieng mina hangcum kak gade hangge. Pa David de ngngwa la, Philistinme hereu tei kera ngkwa ncüt kebam gade penuide hereu tei kera kequ dau, nah Israelme caili kedidau. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Eleazar pe sap ga sap eh pa pe ba mneidi nah pe kingtie hwacuh gailak di kemaktane Philistinme de ngngwa regi. Cipaunai RAMPAUBE ngkiengkelu kedi ge peu. Eleazar cai reugwame ketsai paau gade hereunet lwak kera rünne cailigwang.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Eleazar cai Hararitme pei Agee napei Shammah. Philistinme reteipi luh kebam ga gwang ngkwa lu, nah reugwame penui dade pakdi. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Dede Shammah luh sum ga saplu, delwe cide gumlu. Pa Philistinme de teitsetdi nah RAMPAUBE ngkiengkelu kedige teugwang beu.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Luhlüt kera tingdau reugwame camrei gade hangcum David kebam Adullam tsupop ga hung. Cidau Philistinme reugwamedung Rephaim langkam ga ramzeuki teilwe bam. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Cidau David pe kengkiengbam, tsupop ge ga bam, nah Philistinme ramzeuki Bethlehem ga bam. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />David dui sak neu di nah rangdi, “Magade mige acu dui sak kera Bethlehem ga kirie taiga kebam tekwa de gade dui acu pwa peu liecai!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Cine aipau kengkieng mina hangcum de Philistinme reugwame de nia lütlu nah kirie taiga tekwa kebam, Bethlehem tekwa gade dui twaklu. Penui dui David da teugwang beu, dede pa cide sak laklie di. Meliene, pa cide RAMPAUBE de reca bam gage ruigai di. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Pecai pa rangdi, “A dade mdei dilu RAMPAUBO, Ih aide tei zielie kera. Mina a ziemne penui teilung kerehim gage kai kebeume jai Ih sak zieni?” Cine pa cide sak laklie keli di.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 23:17">Aidungde reugwa kengkieng hangcum batadung da.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Joab sinabe Abishai nah Zeruiah napei ne penui hangcum reu muiteube. Pa piage pengei le mina haicum de regi nah penuide teitsetdi. Pecu de reugwame kengkieng hangcum de si eh rang bamla. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Pa au penui hangcum swa de mlang gwa meni? Pecu penui reu muiteube teilu. Ciuliede pe kenlang reugwa ndusüt kecu hangcum de nzwa nlang luma.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Kabzeel gade kegwangbe, Jehoiada napei Benaiah, pa kengkieng peige nah kekuu bata kekiee teigai. Pa Moabme Ariel napei hangna de teitsetdi. Pa buising keei kebamdau de hekwaki ge ga lüt eh hingho ge de teitsetlu. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Delwe pa Egyptme pei disüt cuge de teitsetdi. Cipau Egyptme pei de pe ba ga hengei bam, dede Benaiah pe tuitie ge rünne le pecu ngngwa regi. Egyptme pei ba gade pa hengei de sütlu, delwe pe hengei de le pecu teitsetdi. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Jehoiada napei Benaiah kekuu bata aidungde teilu nah pecu de reugwa kengkieng hangcum de ngngwa si di. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Pecu reugwame camrei de swa de rüt gwala, dede kengkieng mina hangcum dede kerüt nzwa pecu rüt luma. Dede David pecu peu pe pumkwame reu keteube teilu.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Camrei de ga mina aidungde si: Joab sinabe Asahel, Bethlehem gade kegwangbe Dodo napei Elhanan. <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Harodme pei Shammah nah Harodme Elika, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Paltitme pei Helez, Tekoitme pei Ikkesh napei Ira, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Anathothme pei Abiezer, Hushahme pei Sibbekai <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa LXX laisiudung ga hezi bam</char><char style="fqa">Sibbekai </char> 2 Samuel 21:18 nah 1 Heleuhha 11:29 gade ngau lubui. Hebrew laisiu ga, <char style="fqa">Mebunnai de bam</char>. </note> <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Ahohitme pei Zalmon, Netophathme pei Maharai; <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Netophathme pei Baanah napei Heleb, Benjamin deu Gibeah gade kegwang Ribai napei Ithai, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Pirathonme pei Benaiah, Gaash langkam gade kegwangbe Hiddai. <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Arbahme pei Abi-Albon, Bahurimme pei Azmaveth, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Shaalbonme pei Eliahba, Jashen napei kena, Hararme pei Shammah napei Jonathan, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Hararitme pei Sharar napei Ahiam, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Maacahme pei Ahasbai napei Eliphelet, Gilonitme pei Ahithophel napei Eliam, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Carmelme pei Hezro, Arbitme pei Paarai, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Zobah gade kegwang Nathan napei Igal, Gad leuhme Bani, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Ammonme pei Zelek, Beerothme pei Naharai, Zeruiah napei Joab reunet kepwabe, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ithritme pei Ira, Ithritme pei Gareb, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />Hittime pei Uriah, pelane ge camrei-hena.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">David reugwame pumkepei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />RAMPAUBE rata Israelme da gwangdai delwe Pa David de peu penui reu keherei teugwang gai kera tei eh ranggai, “Mie, Israelme nah Judahme riak peilu.” <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Hegwangpei pecu ngngwa kela reugwame reu kedibe Joab dade rangdi, “Israel leuhme pelane da mie cu, Dan gade Beersheba kecang, delwe mina pelane de peilu, iciude Ih mina daikieege hereu tei lubui bi kecu ci lubui.” <verse eid="2SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Joab hegwangpei dade rangdi, “RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de peu mina pehai kieege tei ngkiee silu, delwe a mpaube hegwangpei miakngau gade cide tei kegaide ngau kelube tei lulo. Dede a mpaube hegwangpei daitei aide teineu lano?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Cinzwa liede, hegwangpei samle kamtube tei Joab dade nah reugwame reu kedime dade. Cine Joab nah kedime hegwangpei dwa gade tetdi, Israelme de pei kerane. <verse eid="2SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Penui Jordan kahpet lu delwe Aroer taiga ge ramzeuki teilu, Aroer namdi tingbangle langkam gage. Pecai penui Gad gade Jazer lebie ge tetgai di. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Penui Gilead ga nah Tahtim Hodshi deu ga gwanglu, pecai Dan Jaan gade nah twagwa kebam Sidon lambie miedi. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Penui Tyre tsukwa nah Hivitme nah Canaanme namdidung pelane ga gwang canglu. Ciu eh penui Judah ga Negev Beersheba ga miedi. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Penui hangdeu pelane ga mbeuh mielu ge, kei hekui kekam lebie, zie ngkai caine Jerusalem ga penui cailigwang dailu. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Pecai Joab hegwangpei dage mina hereu teilu kebui peikelu peciakne paubeu. Israel ga 800,000 mina kuu süt eh cika kingtie kepwame bam, nah Judah ga mina 500,000 ge bam.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Ge David pa mina peei kelucai pe mlung gade pecu mmau di. Cine pa RAMPAUBE dage rangdi, “Ih aide tei eh kemau tei süt dida. Cu, RAMPAUBO, n kilabe mau gi beulo, kedanemene Ih miesüt kecu tatei dida.” <verse eid="2SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />David tingcang cuh luge, RAMPAUBE sam caihakecibe Gad da gwang, David pie kerengeibe dage ranggai, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Mie David dage ranglo: ‘Aide RAMPAUBE ne ranggai: “Ih ncu makie kecum kedet kera peu bam. Cidungde gade ket kedet lulo.”’” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Cine Gad David da mie delwe pe dage ranggai, “N deu ga mmi kecum herakum nda gwang zie mi? Mede nang n ngauraume dade kei cum pak zie mi penui ne ncu zui eh? Mede n deu ga lang cumne rapia bam zie bi? Cu cetlu daipai sam keli eh acu lang kegaibe da Ih teu cailigwang maisia bi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Cidau David Gad dage rangdi, “Ih au aswa gah süt dida. Anuide peu mina ba gage kai kecu swade RAMPAUBE ba gage kaidi lulo, kedanemene pe ngaugia batadung au di sütlu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Cine RAMPAUBE Israelme dage rapia ge langgai, tingcang gade riempwa kebam ting kecang, delwe Dan gade Beersheba ga kecang mina cang riakhena ge tsaidi. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Tinggimgwabe Jerusalem lege pe ba nzang pet ngkapdi lai eh kebam dau, RAMPAUBE kengkap de gade pelung li di nah tinggimgwabe mina de tei ngkap kebambe dage pa ranggai, “Yida! Cu n ba keu caili dilu.” Cipau tingdau RAMPAUBE gwabe Jebusitme pei Araunah caipung ga sap bam. <verse eid="2SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Pecai David tinggimgwabe minadung de teitset kebamme de ngaulu ge, pa RAMPAUBE da mpau eh rangdi, “Ih kemau tei dida, nah Ih heta kesia teigai dida. Dede meurünhau, aidungde penui daipai tei dino? Ngaunggia eh peu acu nah a pei ki kelak da n ba gade saja peu lulo!”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">David recabam ge teikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Ge Cipau nai Gad, David da gwang eh pe dage rangdi, “Hang cu, delwe Jebusitme pei Araunah caipung gage RAMPAUBE de recabam ge tei gaibeu lulo.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Cine RAMPAUBE ajah kaikebeu nzwa, Gad pe dage tei lulo rang kebeu nzwa eh David hang di. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Araunah pie mpet gaige hegwangpei nah pe kilamedung gwang nna kela ngaulu. Cine Araunah tetpet eh hegwangpei dwaga pe zu hangdeu ga keumiedi. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Cidau Araunah rang eh, “A mpaube hegwangpei daitei eh pe kilabe, a da gwang lano?” David keligai, “N hecaipung de luilwe Ih RAMPAUBE ziemne racabam ge tei beu lu kerane, ciu eh minadung dade rapia keumpet dilu kera.” <verse eid="2SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Araunah David dage rang eh, “Hegwangpei, a mpaubo, n katei ngu nzwa keu lulo. Ndwa gade keyibe tei lulo. Pielo, keru reca ziemne aika hetumseudung bam nah tsing ziemne ngwanggaidung nah ciukeneu kwakdung de bam. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Aidung de pelane, Ih Araunah ncu peu zie, a hegwangpei.” Pecai pa hegwangpei dade rang eh, “RAMPAUBE, n Tinggwang depeu n ratak luu kelube tei lulo.” <verse eid="2SA 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Hegwangpei Araunah dage rangdi, “Lak, Ih cide pemi tei eh lui zielie. Ih a dade pemi tei kemak magede pwa RAMPAUBE de keru ratak teibeu gailak.” Cine David caipung de nah hetumseu de rangkanggeu shekel riakngei le luilu. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />David cika ge RAMPAUBE ziemne reca bam teigai beu delwe cipau gage keru ratakdung nah kekangbau ratakdung teigai beu. Cine RAMPAUBE hangdeu be ziemne kekie keligai beu delwe rapia Israel gade mtakdi.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>